<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mata</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo ni kitabu kimwenga mwe vitabu vine ve Ndagano Im'pya vikulonga wikazi wa Yesu Kilisito. Vitabu ivo ivine nivo vikwitangwa Injili, nuko kugamba Mbuli Yedi, vawandikagwa ni Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana, aho Yesu eze ande kabanika. Wamanyi hawamanyize kugamba ni ini aho chawandikagwa ikitabu iki, mna yadahika chawandikagwa mwo mwaka wa milongo mtandatu kulawa aho Yesu eze elekwe. Naho hant'hu kiwandikilwe ikitabu iki hahakumanyika, mna want'hu wengi wahuwila kugamba chawandikagwa ukwo Palesitina, naho mafa mwo mzi wa Yelusalamu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Awandike kitabu iki ni Matayo uyo andaga mtoza kodi aho andaga akei kwitangwa ni Yesu ande mwanamp'hina ywakwe, iviyaiviya amanyikaga kwa zina dya Lawi. Matayo andaga yumwenga mwa wegala ulosi mlongo na waidi naho akiwandikaga vileke kisomigwe ni Wayahudi. Ino yalagisa pwilili ivo avuzagize enga nk'hanana milongo mtandatu mwe mawandiko ya kale. Nakataila kulagisa kugamba Yesu ni Masiha asagulwe ni Mnungu, niye Mkombozi alotelwagwa, uyo asagulwe ni Mnungu. Iviyaiviya Matayo kawandika vitendese mwe mbuli yo Useuta wa Mnungu, Wayahudi wakawiilaga kugamba Masiha naande seuta ywa mwe isi. Matayo akaulisaga kwa wengele mbuli iyo umwo akatambalisa Useuta wa Mnungu we kimuye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo ni kitabu chedi cho kukongela mwe Ndagano Imp'ya kwaivo kivuzagize kwe Ndagano ya Kale, chalunganya Zindagano zimbili. Naho wamanyi wagamba Matayo kageza kutimila vitabu va Musa ivo vili. Viya vitabu vishano va nk'hongo ve Ndagano ya kale. Mabilikizi ya Yesu ukwo kwo mnima, (Matayo 5-7) yadaha kuliganyizwa na hadya Mnungu akumwink'ha Musa miko (Kukumbukila Miko 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1-4, Matayo akonga Mbuli Yedi kwa kusimuila ukwelekwa kwa Yesu no kukonga indima yakwe.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 5-25, Matayo alonga ndima ya Yesu na mahinizo yakwe mengi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 26-28, Matayo asimuila lunenengwa lwe ndima ya Yesu ne file yakwe no kuuyuka kwakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ulu nulo ludongo lwo lukolo lwa Zumbe Yesu Kilisito, mwelekwa ywa Daudi andaga mlukolo ywa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu amwelekaga Isaka, amwelekaga Yakobo, Yakobo amwelekaga Yuda na wanduguze, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda amwelekaga Pelesi na Zela, mamiyawe andaga ni Tamali, Pelesi amwelekaga Heziloni, Heziloni naye amwelekaga Alamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alamu amwelekaga Aminadabu, Aminadabu amwelekaga Nahashoni, Nahashoni amwelekaga Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni amwelekaga Boazi, Boazi etangagwa Lahabu. Boazi amwelekaga Obedi, nine etangagwa Luti, Obedi amwelekaga Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese naye niye amwelekega zumbe Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi amwelekaga Sulemani, nine andaga mkaza Yulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sulemani amwelekaga Lehoboamu, Lehoboamu amwelekaga Abia, Abia amwelekaga Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa amwelekaga Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati amwelekaga Yolamu, Yolamu amwelekaga Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia amwelekaga Yosamu, Yosamu amwelekaga Ahazi, Ahazi amwelekaga Hezekia. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia amwelekaga Manase, Manase amwelekaga Amoni, Amoni amwelekaga Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia amwelekaga Yekonia na wanduguze umwo want'hu wa Izilaeli wegalagwa kwo utumwa uko Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ulu nulo ludongo lwo lukolo, kukongela aho want'hu wa Izilaeli wegalagwa kwo utumwa uko Babeli. Yekonia amwelekaga Shealitieli, Shealitieli amwelekaga Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli amwelekaga Abihudi, Abihudi amwelekaga Eliakimu, Eliakimu amwelekaga Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli amwelekaga Zadoki, Zadoki amwelekaga Akimu, Akimu amwelekaga Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi amwelekaga Eliazali, Eliazali naye amwelekaga Matani, Matani amwelekaga Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo amwelekaga Yusufu, mnumewe dya Maliamu uyo nine dya Yesu akwitangwa Kilisito Mkombozi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ivo vatenda, kulawa Ibulahimu mpaka kwa Daudi vyeleko mlongo na vine, kulawa Daudi mpaka hadya want'hu wa Izilaeli waguhagwa utumwa uko Babiloni, vyeleko mlongo na vine, naho kulawa aho mpaka mwo kwelekwa kwa Zumbe Yesu Kilisito, vyeleko mlongo na vine.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kwelekwa kwa Zumbe Yesu kwandaga ivi. Maliamu uyo nine dya Yesu Kilisito, atumizagwa ni Yusufu. Umwo wandaga wakei kwikala enga ivo vili kwa mnt'hu na mkaziwe, Maliamu aonekaga kunda mbovu kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwaviya Yusufu andaga mnt'hu akumwelela Mnungu, haungile kumgela soni mwa want'hu, ivo aungaga amwase Maliamu kwa kinyele. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Umwo andaga akafanyanya ivo, mtumigwa ywa Zumbe niyo amlaila mwe zisozi akamgamba, “Yusufu, mwelekwa ywa Daudi, usekogoha kumguha Maliamu kunda mkaziyo kwaviya ubovu ananao ni kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Neeleke mwana kilume, naho noumwitange zina dyakwe niye Yesu, kwaviya niye akuunga awayokole want'hu wakwe walawe mwo uwavu wawe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Aya yose yalailaga vileke kia kindedi cha Zumbe alongaga kombokela kwa mlotezi ywakwe kikelavilize,<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Kaula, mwali na mazanga neenule ubovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">naho kwakwe naavumbuke mwana kilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">zina dyakwe neetangwe Imanueli” nuko kugamba, “Mnungu ehamwenga na suwe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ivo Yusufu eze enuke mwe zint'hongo, amlomba Maliamu enga viya agambilwe ni mtumigwa ywa Zumbe. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Mna hawagendaga enga mnt'hu na mkaziwe mpaka hadya Maliamu amwelekaga mwanawe ywa kilume, niyo Yusufu amwink'ha zina niye Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wamanyi we zint'hondo kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Aho Yesu eze elekwe mwo mzi wa Betelehemu uko Uyahudi, umwo Helode andaga seuta, wamanyi we zint'hondo wezaga Yelusalemu kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />wakauza kugamba “Ekuhi mwana elekwe akuunga ande Seuta ywa Wayahudi? Kwaviya nekiona nt'hondo yakwe kwo ulawilo wa zuwa, ivo kiza kimvike.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Helode hamwenga na want'hu wose wa Yelusalemu weze weve ivo, wengilaga kinyulu mwe mioyo yawe. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Niyo awetanga wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wose hamwenga na wahinizi we Miko ya Musa, akawauza, “Kilisito Mkombozi neelekwe hi?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Niyo wamhitula, “Neelekwe mwo mzi wa Betelehemu yo Uyahudi.” Kwaviya nivo vawandikagwa ni walotezi kugamba,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />Weye Betelehemu, mwe isi ya Uyahudi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">hwi mdodo mwe mizi ya Uyahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kwaviya kilongozi naalawe kwako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">akuunga awalongoze want'hu wangu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ivo Helode niyo awetanga kwe njama wadya want'hu wezile kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa, niyo wamgambila ikindedi che int'hondo idya kukongela aho yakongaga kulaila. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Niyo awagamba, “Iteni Betelehemu mkapelembe kwa wengele izimbuli zo mwana. Mkajika kumuwona, mwize mnigambile vileke name hamvike.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Zumbe Helode eze abinde kuwagambila, niyo wahalawa. Umwo mwe sila niyo waiona idya int'hondo waione ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Weze waione idya int'hondo, welelwagwa kwa kinyemi kikulu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Wengilaga mwe nyumba niyo kumuwona umwana hamwenga na nine Maliamu. Niyo wamfikila madi na kumvika. Wamwink'haga umwana mageleko ya zahabu na mavumba na mavuta ya mhemp'he.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Mnungu eze wawakanye mwe zisozi kugamba wase kumwombokela Helode, wauyaga kwawe wakombokela sila nt'huhu.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyilikila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Woho weze wahalawe, mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe amgambilaga Yusufu mwe zisozi akamgamba, “Helode amzungula umwana vileke amkome. Haluse inuka umguhe mwana hamwenga na nine mnyilikile Misili mkekale ukwo mpaka aho nenize nimitangeni.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yusufu enukaga ikilo iicho niyo akumguha umwana hamwenga na nine, niyo waita Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Wekalaga uukwo Misili mpaka aho Helode eze abanike. Ino yalailaga vileke kiya alongaga Zumbe kwombokela mlotezi ywakwe kugamba, “Nehimwitanga mwanangu kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwa wana kilume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode eze abunk'hule kugamba kadant'hilizwa ni wadya wamanyi we zint'hondo kulawa ulailo wa zuwa, engilaga maya niyo asigiila wana kilume wose wabuile myaka miidi kwiza hasi, ukwo Betelehemu hamwenga na kaya zose zi mgihi na aaho, wakomigwe. Ino nayo yadamanyikaga viligane no lupisi lukukongela aho evilaga kulawa kwa wadya wamanyi we zint'hondo kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Niho ulotezi wa Yelemia mlotezi ywa Mnungu wakelavilizaga. Udya ukugamba,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Izwi dyevikaga ukwo Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">izwi dya ndilo nk'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli akawaiila wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">alemelaga kutondoazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kwaviya haawaone naho.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Helode eze abanike, mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe amlailaga Yusufu mwe zisozi ukwo Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akamgamba, “Mguhe umwana na nine muuye kwe isi ya Izilaeli kwaviya wadya nawakaunga wamkome umwana wabanika.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ivo Yusufu enukaga no kumguha umwana hamwenga na nine, niyo wauya kwe isi ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Mna Yusufu eze eve kugamba, Alikelao niye akulongoza ukwo Uyahudi hant'hu ha Helode uyo ise, ogohaga kuita ukwo. Enk'hagwa makanyo matuhu mwe zisozi, naivo ahingaga nt'hendelo za Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Niyo agenda kwikala mwo mzi ukwitangwa Nazaleti, vileke ulotezi wa mlotezi ywa Mnungu ulaile, udya ukugamba, “Neetangwe Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Mabilikizi ya Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mwa mazuwa yadya, Yohana Mbatizi alailaga mwe dijangwa dya Uyahudi akabilikiza, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />akagamba “Lekeni wavu wenyu,” “kwaviya Useuta wa kwe mbingu uhaguhi!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohana niye alotelagwa ni mlotezi ywa Mnungu Isaya kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Izwi dya mnt'hu akubongeela mwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Ikeni lumwe sila ya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">chumizeni lwombokelo lwake! ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana avalaga suke idamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngamia. Mwe kigudi avalaga mkoa wa nk'hingo, nk'hande yakwe yandaga sige no uki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Want'hu kulawa Yelusalemu hamwenga na Uyahudi na mwe si zose hagihi ne Yolodani wamwizilaga. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Wakweiilaga wavu wawe, niyo Yohana awabatiza mwo mto Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Yohana eze awaone Mafalisayo hamwenga na Masadukayo wambasa awabatize, niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe cheleko che nyoka, niani awagambileni kugamba mwadaha kunyilika maya ya Mnungu yakwiza? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Lagiseni kwa udamanyi kugamba muuleka uwavu wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Naho msekugamba mwadaha kukehonya na maya ya Mnungu kwa kugamba mnanaye tati yenyu akwitangwa Ibulahimu. Nawagambilani, Mnungu adaha kuguha maiwe aya niyo amdamanyila Ibulahimu welekwa mwa maiwe aya. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Hoya diikilwa kale he nk'holo yo mti. Mti wowose howiina cheleko chedi nousengwe no kokigwa mwo moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ikindedi, miye nawabatizani kwa mazi kulagisa kugamba mkweiila wavu wenyu. Mna eza mto udahi kunijink'ha miye. Naho hikuwagilwa kwinula vilatu vakwe. Yehe naawamibatizeni kwa Muye ywa Mnungu na kwa moto wa usengelo. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Naho lungo lwakwe ananalo mwe mikono vileke ahete vedi ngano. Naadihagile vedi digulu dyakwe niyo aigela umwo, mna mahofya naayagele mwo moto houkuzima.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abatizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Mwa mazuwa yadya, Yesu abulaga Yolodani akalawa Galilaya, vileke abatizwe ni Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Mna Yohana aungaga amlemele, akagamba, “Miye naungwa nibatizwe ni weye, weye nawe weza kwangu hubatize!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Zumila ivi haluse, kwaviya kwa kudamanya aya, nekinde kikint'hiza yadya yose akuunga Mnungu.” Ivo Yohana niyo azumila kumbatiza.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Aho Yesu eze ajike kubatizwa, afosaga mwa mazi. Mbingu niyo zagubuka, naho aonaga Muye ywa Mnungu akaseela kulawa kwe mbingu enga suwa, niyo amkima. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Izwi kulawa kwe mbingu dyevikaga dikagamba, “Uyu niye Mwanangu nimuungise, hyeleleswa naye.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agezigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Muye ywa Mnungu niyo amwigalaga Yesu kwe dijangwa vileke akagezigwe nu Mwavu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Eze ekale mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi haheina kudya chochose, akeivaga sala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Mgezi amwiiziilaga niyo amgamba, “Uneva kindedi weye ywi Mwana Mnungu, yagambe maiwe aya yande nk'hande.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Mna Yesu niyo amgamba, “Iwandikwa kugamba, Mnt'hu haaikwe ni kudya nk'hande du, mna naaikwe ni kiya akulonga Mnungu. ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Naho Mwavu niyo amwigala Yesu uko Yelusalemu, mzi ukukile, niyo amkweza kwo lunenengwa lwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Niyo amgamba, “Uneva ywi Mwana Mnungu, keduule hasi, kwaviya iwandikwa kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Mnungu naawagambe watumigwa wa kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">wakupoele mwe mikono yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">vileke use kukakobadisa ikiga chako mwe diiwe. ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Iwandikwa kugamba, Use kumgeza Zumbe Mnungu ywako. ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Mwavu niyo amwigala Yesu kwo mnima mtali, no kumlagisa useuta wose umwe isi hamwenga no uwedi wakwe utendedse. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Mwavu niyo amgamba, “Nohwink'he ivi vose,” “uneva unanifikila madi na kunivika.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Halawe aha, weye Mwavu! Iwandikwa kugamba, Umfikile madi Zumbe Mnungu ekedu, naho umdamanyile ndima yehe du! ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Niyo Mwavu amleka Yesu, watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wamwizilaga Yesu, niyo wamwambiza.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akonga ndima yakwe uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu eze eve Yohana kavugailwa kwe divugailo, aitaga Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Hekalaga Nazaleti, ivo agendaga kwikala Kapelinaumu, mzi umnk'handa ye diziwa dya Galilaya, mwe mihaka ye wilaya ya Zabuloni na Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Idi dyadamanyika vileke yadya alongaga mlotezi ywa Mnungu Isaya yakint'he kugamba,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Si za Zabuloni na si za Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">sila ya mwe bahali kujink'hanya ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, isi ya want'hu hi Wayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Want'hu wakwikala mwo lwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">wauwona unga'zi mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Na wose wakwikala mwe isi yo lwiza lwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">ung'azi uwang'azila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kukongela aho, Yesu andaga akabilikiza akagamba, “Lekeni wavu wenyu, kwaviya Useuta wa Mnungu uhagihi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etanga walowa samaki wane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu andaga akagenda mwe mp'wani ye diziwa dya Galilaya, aonaga wandugu waidi wandaga wakalowa samaki, Simoni etangagwa Petulo, na nduguye Anduleya wandaga wakaika lumwe zinyavu zawe kwaviya wandaga ni walowa samaki. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nitimileni, name neni watendeni walowa want'hu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Aaho, wazilekaga zinyavu zawe, niyo wamtimila.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Agendeelaga halongole, niyo aona wandugu watuhu waidi, Yakobo na Yohana, wana Zebedayo hamwenga na Zebedayo tati yawe, wandaga mwe ngalawa wakaika lumwe zinyavu zawe. Yesu niyo awetanga. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Aaho niyo waileka ingalawa na tati yawe niyo wamtimila Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahiniza no kuhonya wakulumwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu agendaga mwe isi yose ya Galilaya akahiniza mwe zinyumba zo kumvika Mnungu, akabilikiza Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta naho ahonyaga wakulumwa wengi no kuwahonya wose wandaga na maine. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Zimbuli zakwe niyo zenela mwe isi yose ya Asilia, vitendile want'hu wamwigaile want'hu wose wandile wakahuma na wadya nawakakunt'hizwa ni maine yose na hewe kukedaha, wata mp'hepo, wata vifafa, na wadya waholole. Yesu awahonyaga wose. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Fyo kulu dya want'hu kulawa Galilaya na Mizi mlongo dyamtimilaga Yesu. Isi ina mizi mlongo kulawa Yelusalemu na Uyahudi, ne nga'mbu ya Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Mahinizo ya Yesu kwo mnima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu eze auone mdugano mkulu wa want'hu, akwelaga kwo mnima niyo ekala hasi. Wadya wanamp'hina nao wambasaga niyo wamzunguluka, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />niyo akonga kuwahiniza akagamba,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyemi che kindedi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Wavikilwa wadya wose wakumhuwila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kwaviya Useuta wa kwe mbingu ni wawe!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Wavikilwa wadya wose wakuhongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">Mnungu naawatondowaze!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Wavikilwa wata ujalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kwaviya nawande wakipe we isi!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Wavikilwa wadya wose wata nk'hilu na sala ya kudamanya yadya yakumwelela Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">Mnungu naawenk'he va kumema!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Wavikilwa wadya wata mbazi na weyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">kwaviya Mnungu naande na mbazi nawo!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Wavikilwa wadya wata mioyo yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kwaviya nawamuwone Mnungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Wavikilwa wadya wakuwalunganya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">kwaviya nawetangwe wana Mnungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Wavikilwa wadya wose nawadamanyilwe wiihi kwa kudamanya yadya yakumwelela Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kwaviya Useuta wa kwe mbingu ni wawe!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Nomvikilwe umwo want'hu wakawakalalizani no kuwasulumiza, no kuwalonga vihile kwajili ya miye. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Indeni na kinyemi na kwanga, kwaviya maliho yenyu ni makulu uko kwe mbingu. Ivi nivo watendelwagwa awalotezi awo wandaga uuko nk'hongo aho nyuwe mwandaga hamnati mwize.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu no ung'azi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Nyuwe mwi munyu we isi. Mna uneva munyu unabanika, hahana cho kuutenda uuiye ukimunyu wakwe. Hiwo wedi naho, waduulwa kuse niyo wajatwa ni want'hu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Nyuwe mwi ung'azi we isi. Mzi una zengwa henukile haukudaha kukefisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Naho hahali mnt'hu akukweleza lumuli, niyo alwiika kwe divungu. Mna nolwiikwe hant'hu henukile vileke want'hu wose wauone ung'azi mwe nyumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Viligane na ivo, ung'azi wenyu nanywe ung'ale mwa want'hu, vileke wakaule ayedi mkudamanya, wamtogole Tati yenyu ywa kwe mbingu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo ye Miko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mnasekugamba hiza kuiusa Miko ya Musa hegu mbuli za walotezi. Hizile kutenda ivo, mna hiza kuzikint'hiza. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Namigambilani kindedi, mbingu ne isi nevomboke mna hakihali nekihunguke mwe Miko, mpaka kwo uheelo we vint'hu vose. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Mnt'hu yeyose akuunga abanange Mwiko umwenga mwe Miko ino imidodo mwa yose, no kuwahiniza want'hu enga ivo yehe akudamanya, naande mdodo kwo Useuta wa kwe mbingu. Nuko kugamba yeyose akuzumila Miko na kuhiniza watuhu kudamanya ayo, naande mkulu kwo Useuta wa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Naivo nawagambani, nomwingile kwo Useuta wa kwe mbingu uneva kumwelela Mnungu kwenyu kunajink'ha kudya kwa wahinizi we Miko hamwenga na Mafalisayo.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo mwe mbuli yo ukomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwiva kugamba aho kale neigambigwa, ‘Use kukoma, naho mnt'hu akukoma, naasengelwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Naho nawagambani nyuwe, yeyose akuunga amwihiye miyawe naasengelwe, naho yeyose akuunga ambele nduguye, neegalwe kwe kitala. Naho akuunga amgambe nduguye kugamba, ‘Weye ywi hezi!’ Naageligwe mwo moto houkuzima, wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Elo, uneva waunga ukalave malavo kwe kilingo cho kumlavila Mnungu, niyo wakumbukila kugamba eyuko nduguyo mwikailane vihile, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />inda uyaleke malavo ayo he kilingo cho kulavila malavo, wiite kwa uyo nduguyo mwikalane vihile, mkaivane niho wiite ukalave malavo yako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Sunguza kuivana na yudya akulongeleze mkei mpaka kwe kitala. Unagoja mbule he kitala naakwink'hize kwo mkulu we kitala, mkulu ywe kitala naye naakwink'hize kwa mtowani, mtowani naye akugela kwe divugailo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, homfose uko mpaka mbinde kuliha ditundu dyo uheelo dikwitangwa shekeli.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo mwe mbuli yo Uhabwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwiva igambigwa, ‘Usekugenda na mvele ywa mnt'hu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Mna miye nawagambani, akuunga amkaule mvele no kumunk'hilwa naye, kagendanaye kale mwo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Uneva ziso dyako dyo kulume dyakugela mwo uwavu, ding'ole udiduule, nevindilise vedi una swesa kilungo kimwenga mwo mwili kujink'ha kunda no mwili wose, mna uduulwe kwo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Mkono wako wo kulume unakugela mwo wavu ukant'he uuduule. Nivedi uuswese kujink'ha kunda no mwili wose mna uduulwe kwo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo mwe mbuli yo kwasana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Naho igambigwa, ‘Mnt'hu akumwasa mkaziwe amuwandikile talaka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Mna miye nawagambani, mnt'hu akuunga amwase mkaziwe haheina lema, mafa kwa kugenda na mgosi ywa kuse, amtenda kunda mhabwasi, naho akuunga amlombe akehabwasa hamwenga naye.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelisila vint'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Naho mwiva kugamba, aho kale want'hu nawagambigwa, ‘Msekuusa kilapi, mna kint'hizeni yadya mwikile kilapi kwa Zumbe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Mna miye nawagambani, msekugeza kukelisila hata kwe mbingu, kwaviya mbingu nuwo ukalo wa Mnungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />naho mse kukelisila isi kwaviya umwo numwo Mnungu akuikila viga vakwe, naho msekukelisila Yelusalemu kwaviya nuwo mzi wa Seuta mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Naho use kwelisila umtwi wako kwaviya houdahe kudamanya hata luvili lumwenga mwo mtwi lunde lung'aile, hegu lutitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Yose mkuunga myalonge gambeni, ‘Heiye hegu du bule.’ Hadihali dikujink'ha aho, idyo dyalawa kwa Mwavu.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo yo kulihiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Naho mwiva kugamba, ‘Ziso kwa ziso naho zino kwa zino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Mna miye nawagambani, mse kumliha mwiihi. Uneva mnt'hu anakutowa mwe funda yo kumoso, mhituile yo kulume nayo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Uneva mnt'hu anakwigala kwe kitala vileke akuhoke ishati yako, mwink'he ne dikoti. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Naho uneva mnt'hu anakugendeza kwa udahi wakwe maili imwenga, weye genda naye maili maidi. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mnt'hu akukulombeza kint'hu, mwink'he. Use kumlemela akuunga kukukopa.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwaunga wank'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwiva ivo ilongigwe kugamba, ‘Muunge uywako, mna muihiye mnk'hondo ywako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Mna miye nawagambani, waungeni awank'hondo wenyu naho muwalombezele wose wakuwatendelani wiihi, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ivo nomnde wana Tati yenyu ekulanga kwaviya, yehe awang'azila ung'azi we dizuwa, waihile na awedi hamwenga, naho awenk'ha fula wose wakumwelela na hewe kumwelela. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Elo Mnungu naawaliheni mbwai uneva mnawaunga wakumwelelani du? Elo wakugwila kodi, nawo nagamba wadamanya aayo? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Naho mnawalamsa wandugu zenyu du mdamanya dihi kujink'ha awatuhu? Kwaviya hata wadya hewemmanyize Mnungu watenda enga aayo. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Elo kint'heni enga viya Tati yenyu ywa kwe mbingu ivo akint'hile”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mahinizo mwo ukise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Msinyise msekudamanya uwedi hameso ya want'hu vileke wawatogoleni, kwa kudamanya ivo, homhokele nt'hunyo yoyose kulawa kwa Tati yenyu ywa kwe mbingu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Elo, mkawenk'ha wakiwa vint'hu usekutoa lugong'ondo enga watondwe ivo wakutenda mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila na mwe zisila, vileke wakaulwe no kutogolwa ni want'hu. Nawagambilani ikindedi, wahokela kale amaliho yawe yose. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Mna nyuwe mkawambiza wakiwa, damanyeni kwa kinyele kugamba hata ehagihi na weye asekumanya. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Malavo yako udamanye kwa kinyele, Mnungu akukaula kwe kinyele niye naawatunyeni.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Ukalombeza use kulombeza enga want'hu watondwe, waungisa kuvika mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila na mwe zisila mp'handa, vileke wakaulwe ni want'hu. Nawagambilani ikindedi, wahokela kale maliho yawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Mna nyuwe mkalombeza, ingileni kwe nyumba kundani niyo mwavugala lwivi. Mlombezeni Mnungu heekuoneka akusinya kwo moyo, naawa tunyeni.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Naho mkalombeza, msekulalata kwa mbuli nyingi enga hewe mmanyize Mnungu, wakagamba nawevigwe kwo wingi we zimbuli mwo kulombeza kwawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mnase kunda enga woho, kwaviya Tati yenyu kamanya kale kiya mkuunga, mkanda mkei kulonga naye. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Elo mkamlombeza Mnungu, gambeni ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Tati yetu ywa kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Zina dyako ditogolwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Useuta wako wize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">vinde viya ukuunga weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">aha he isi enga ivo kwili ukwo kwe mbingu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ukink'he dielo nk'hande ya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ukiusile wavu wetu kitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">enga naswe viya kikuwausila wadya wakukitendela wavu.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Usekukigela mwa magezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">mna uki yokole kulawa mwo Mwavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kwaviya Useuta ni wako, no udahi no ukulu, ulo na ulo. Taile.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Mnawausila wadya wakuwatendelani wavu, Tati yenyu ywa kwe mbingu naye naawa usileni nyuwe wavu wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Mna hamna wausile wadya wawatendeleni wavu, Tati yenyu ywa kwe mbingu naye haawausileni wavu wenyu mtendile.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo yo ukufunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Naho mkafunga, msekunda want'hu wana kinyulu mwe vihanga, enga ivo watondwe wakutenda. Woho wabilinga vihanga vawe vileke want'hu wamanye kugamba wafunga. Nawagambilani kugamba awo wahokela kale amaliho yawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Mna nyuwe mkafunga, hakeni mavuta mwe mitwi yenyu naho mhake mazi mwe vihanaga venyu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />vileke watuhu wasekumanya kugamba mfunga, amanye Tati yenyu du e kulanga heekuoneka. Yehe akudaha kukaula yadya ya kwe kinyele naawatunyeni.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kindolo cha kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mse kukeikila vindolo aha he isi, aha vikubanangwa ni vimungu ne kanga, naho wahoki nawamole no kubawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Keikileni ugoli kulanga ukwo vimungu ne kanga hevikudaha kubananga naho wahoki hawakudaha kumola niyo kubawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwaviya mioyo yenyu neikekale kudya wili vindolo venyu.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ung'azi wo mwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Ziso nulo lumuli lwo mwili, uneva ziso dyako dinanda gima mwili wako wose nounde no ung'azi. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Mna uneva ziso dyako hidyo gima, mwili wako wose nounde mwe diziza tilili. Mna uneva udya ung'azi umwako ni lwiza, ulo nolunde lwiza lwa kutisa!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Useuta wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Hahali mnt'hu akudaha kunda mtumwa ywa mazumbe waidi, naamuungise yumwenga no kumbela mtuhu, naamwase yumwenga no kunda no mtuhu. Hukudaha kudamanyila ndima Mnungu no ugoli.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ivi nivo vikuleka nawagambilani kugamba, msekunda na kiyangayanga ne nk'hande mkagamba nekidyei nekinywei, naho nekivalei. Togoleni ugima haujink'hile nk'hande, mwili nao houjink'hile zisuke? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Kauleni madege, hayadahile kuhanda na kuvuna, na kugela kwedigulu. Hamwenga naayo, Tatiyenyu ekulanga ayenk'ha nk'hande. Togoleni, nyuwe hamyajink'hile yoho mwo uwagilwa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Niani mwa nyuwe, kwa kunda na kiyangayanga naakeongezele utali hata mkono umwenga?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Naho nii mwafanyanyisa izisuke? Hake kauleni mabwali ivo yakukula, hayana ndima yoyose. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Mna nawagambilani, hata Sulemani mwo uwedi wakwe utendese wose, akei kuhambwa enga ve mihambilwe ya mabwali aya. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Uneva Mnungu adaha kuyavala vedi mani ya kwe mbago yakunda aaho dielo na luvi yaduulwa kwo moto, haadahise kuwavalani nyuwe?, Nyuwe mhungukilwe ni mhuwi!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Elo, mse kunda na kiyangayanga mkagamba, nekidyei, ne kivalei, hegu nekinywei? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Want'hu hewemmanyize Mnungu nawo wafanyanya enga ivo, na Tati yenyu ekwe mbingu kamanya kugamba, mwayaunga ayo yose, naho na awenk'heni ayo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Naivo elo, indeni kuuzungula nk'hongo Useuta wa Mnungu na yadya yakumwelela, niho nomwongezelwe aya yose. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Elo, mse kuyafanyanya ya luvi, kwaviya luvi ina makunt'ho yakwe yenye. Makunt'ho ye dizuwa dimwenga naya mkint'heni.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuwasengela watuhu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Msekuwasengela weenyu, sema nanywe mna sengelwe, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />enga viya mkuwasengela weenyu nanywe nomsengelwe iivo, ne kihimo kiya mkuwahimila weenyu, nicho nomhimilwe nanywe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Mna nii wakaulisa kabasi ke kwe diziso dya nduguyo, haheina kukaula kasoso kekwe diziso dyako we mwenye? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Vivihi umgambe nduguyo hake goja hulave kabasi ke mwe diziso dyako, mna we mwenye ziso ditungwa ni soso? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Weye mtondwe, hake yanda kulava kasoso ke mwediziso dyako, niho unaone vedi akabasi kemwe diziso dya nduguyo.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Msekwink'ha makuli kint'hu kikukile, naho mse kuduula vint'hu va ugoli hana nguluwe, kwaviya, sema zinavijatangize no kuwahitukilani niyo zawasabant'hulani.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza na kuzungula na kugamba kuno</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Lombezeni nomwink'higwe, zunguleni no mbunk'hule, toweni hodi mkomwoelwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwaviya, akulombeza, neenk'higwe, naho akuzungula, naabunk'hule, na wose nawatowe hodi nawakomoelwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Hegu eyuko mwa nyuwe watate, akuunga amwink'he palamba mwanawe hant'hu hakumwink'ha nk'hade iyo alombeze? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Hegu wadaha kumwink'ha nyoka hant'hu ha kumwink'ha samaki iyo alombeze? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Uneva nyuwe want'hu mwihile, mwadaha kwink'ha wana wenyu vint'hu vedi, Tati yenyu e kulanga, haasump'hule kuwenk'ha vint'hu vedi wose wakulombeza kwakwe?<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Wadamanyileni want'hu viya nyuwe mkuunga kudamanyilwa kwaviya ino niyo miko ya Musa, hamwenga na mahinizo ya walotezi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi lufinyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Yombokeleni mwo lwivi lufinyu, kwaviya lwivi luzangalamuka, sila nayo ikuita kwo kubanika zangalamu naho mp'hufu, wakombokela isila iyo wengi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Mna sila ikuita kwo ugima finyu naho ifint'wa, naho wakuiona wageke.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mti wamanyika kwa cheleko chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Indeni na wengele mwa walotezi wo udant'hi, want'hu wakuunga waweziileni wakanda enga ngoto, mna kundani ni mauzi yaihile. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Nomuwabunk'huile mwe zimbuli zawe wakudamanya. Zabibu hazikwahigwa mwe miwambangoma. Naho matunduja hayahigwe mwe zimbigili. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ziti dyodyose dyedi, dyeleka matunda yedi, diihile nadyo dyeleka matunda yaihile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Ziti dyedi hedidahe kweleka matunda yaihile. Ziti diihile nadyo hedyeleke matunda yedi. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ziti dyodyose, hediikweleka matunda yedi, idyo dya sengwa no kugeligwa moto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Elo nomuwamanye mwe zimbuli zawe ziya wakudamanya.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiwamanyizeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Hiwo wose wakunitanga, Zumbe, wakuunga wengile mwo Useuta wa kwe mbingu, mna niwadya du wakuunga wadamanye yadya yakumwelela Tate ywa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Want'hu wengi mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo nawanigambe, Zumbe, suwe hachadamanye ulotezi kwa zina dyako, naho kwe dizina dyako chalavaga mp'hepo, no kudamanya vihungi! <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Niho neniwagambe, Hiwamanyizeni. Halaweni aha hangu, nyuwe mkudamanya uwavu!<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Elo mnt'hu yeyose akuunga anitegeleze mbuli zangu, niyo adamanya enga ivo, uyo aliganyizwa no mnt'hu azengile nyumba yakwe mnanga mwo luwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Fula ize inye, mazi niyo yamema, nk'hung'unto niyo yaikungudisa inyumba, mna haiyukile hasi, kwaviya neizengelwa mwo luwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Naho mnt'hu yeyose akuunga anayeve aya hulonga, niyo ase kutenda enga ivo, naaliganywe na mnt'hu mhezi, azengile nyumba yakwe mwe msanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Fula niyo yanya mito niyo yamema na kumwaguka, nk'hung'unto niyo yaitowa inyumba niyo yagwa, naho cheleka chakwe ni kikulu!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Aho Yesu eze abinde milosi iyo, want'hu weheeleswagwa mwaivo naakahiniza, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />kwaviya ahinizaga enga mnt'hu mta udahi naho hiyo enga wahinizi we Miko.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mnt'hu mta matana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu eze auye kulawa kwo mnima, atimilagwa ni mafyo makulu ya want'hu. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mta matana amwiziilaga Yesu akamfikila madi akamgamba, “Zumbe, uneva ukaunga, wadaha kunitenda nisunt'hike.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Niyo Yesu achulula mikono yakwe, niyo amkwafa uku aka mhitula kugamba, “Naunga.” “Sunt'hika!” Aaho, niyo yudya mta matana ahona. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Niyo Yesu amgamba, “Kaula usekugambila mnt'hu yeyose. Mna wiite kwa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu ukakelagise kwakwe, unde uwona kwa want'hu wose kugamba kuhona, naho ukalave malavo enga viya Musa asigiilaga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mtumwa ywo mkulu we Kilumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Aho Yesu engilaga Kapelinaumu, mkulu yumwenga ywe Kilumi amwiziilaga akalombeza kwambizwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Akagamba, “Zumbe kaya, eyuko mtumwa ywangu mwo lusazi, alumwa unyonge wa kuholomp'hala, alumiswa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Neniite hamhonye.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Yudya mkulu niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, miye hina wedi ukint'hile, vikuunga vileke weye ubule kwe nyumba yangu. Weye longa mbuli du, mndima ywangu naahone. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwaviya miye name ni mnt'hu mkulu, naho nna watowani we mwe udahi wangu. Nnamgamba yumwenga, Ita! Aita, hegu nnamgamba mtuhu So! Eza, naho nnamgamba mtumwa ywangu, Tenda ivi! Atenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu eze eve ivo, eheelwagwa, niyo awagamba wadya want'hu wamtimilaga kugamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, hinati kuwona mhuwi mkulu enga uno kwa mnt'hu yeyose aha he Izilaeli.” <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Naho nawagambilani, mafyo ya want'hu kulawa ulailo wa zuwa no usweelo we dizuwa, niyo wekala hamwenga na Ibulahimu, na Isaka, na Yakobo mwo Useuta wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Mna wadya wakuungwa kunda mwo Useuta nawaduulwe kuse kwo lwiza, nuko nokunde ndilo no kugwegwejula meno. <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yesu niyo amgamba yudya mkulu, “Kweitile kaya, nevinde enga viya ukuhuwila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Aaho, yudya mtumwa ywo mkulu niyo anda kahona.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mafyo ya want'hu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu aitaga kwe kaya kwa Petulo. Uuko ambwiilaga nine mdodo, emwo lusazi, alumwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu amtozaga mkono, niyo aaho enuka ahonile, niyo akonga kuwa sank'honila.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Ize ibule mwalagulo, want'hu wamwigailaga wata mp'hepo, hamwenga na wose wandile heweekukedaha, Yesu niyo awahonya kwa ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Aya yose yandaga ni kukint'hiza yadya yalogagwa ni mlotezi Isaya, akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Yehe mwenye kakihokela usokezi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">kakihokela maine yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawagilwe kunda na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu eze aone idifyo dya want'hu dyamzunguluka, awagambaga wanamp'hina wakwe wajink'hanye nt'hendelo ya kaidi ye diziwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mhinizi yumwenga ywe Miko amwizilaga, niyo amgamba, “Mhinizi,” “Miye nohutimile hohose nouite.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mabwasiko yana ugono ywawe kwezimp'hanga, madege nayo yana vyaila vawe, mna Mwana Mnt'hu kaswesa ho kuika umtwi wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wakwe niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, goja hande kummosa tate.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yesu niyo amhitula kugamba, “Waleke wazimu wakaika wawamose msanga wazimu weyawe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aunyamaza umjubwaniso.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu eze engile mwe ngalawa, wanamp'hina wakwe nao niyo wamtimila. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Kwandaga mjubwaniso mkulu mwe bahali, naho ingalawa yandaga aka didimila, mna Yesu andaga kagona. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wanamp'hina niyo wamwinula, wakamgamba, “Zumbe kiyokole!” “Kihagihi na kubanika!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mwogohai nyuwe mhungukilwe nu mhuwi?” Yesu enukaga niyo akonga kuitivila idya ink'hung'unt'ho, mjubwaniso wanyamalaga, niyo kwa tondowala.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Want'hu wose niyo weehelwa, wakagamba, “Uyu ni mnt'hu ywa vivihi akwivigwa hata ni nk'hung'unt'ho ne mijubwaniso ye bahali!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wata mp'hepo waidi wahonywa ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu eze abule ng'ambu mwe isi ya Wagelasi, aduganaga na want'hu waidi wandaga na mp'hepo wandaga wakalawa kwe vikuta. Wandaga wakali vidala, naho hakwandaga na mnt'hu yeyose adahaga kombokela mwe sila iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Niyo wagutiila wakagamba, “Kikubanangai weye mwana Mnungu? Weye kwiza kukisulumiza hekiinati mpaka mwo lupisi lwetu lwo kusulumizwa?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Handaga na fyo dya nguluwe dyandaga dikadya luhalehale. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ziya zimp'hepo zamlombezaga Yesu kugamba, “Uneva wakilava mwa want'hu awa, kigambe kikengile mwe zinguluwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu niyo azigamba, “Iteni.” Niyo zafosa mwa uyo mnt'hu no kwingila mwe zinguluwe. Idifyo dyose dye zinguluwe niyo dyatula nguluko, niyo dyose dyadidimila mwe diziwa dya mazi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Wadya wadimi we zinguluwe, niyo waguluka kwo mzi niyo wawagambila want'hu mbuli zose, hamwenga na yadya yawalaile wadya wandile ne zimp'hepo. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Niyo mzi wose wagenda kumsingila Yesu. Weze wamuwone, niyo wamlombeza kugamba, amlawe mwe isi yawe.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu aholomp'hale.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu engilaga mwe ngalawa niyo ajink'hanya mwe digundi ye diziwa, no kwingila mwo mzi wa kwawe. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Want'hu wamwigailaga mnt'hu aholomp'hale alambalikagwa mwo lusazi. Yesu eze aone uwedi utendese wo mhuwi wawe, niyo amgamba yudya aholomp'hale, “Mwanangu, keink'he moyo, kuusilwa wavu wako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Niyo wahinizi wamwenga we miko, walosanyaga wakagamba, “Mnt'hu uyu amhomola Mnungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu abunk'hulaga zifanyanyi zawe niyo awagamba, “Nii mwafanyanya wiihi mwe mioyo yenyu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ni kihi kihufu vitendese, kugamba, kuusilwa wavu wako, hegu kugamba, inuka ugende? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Viya naunga niwalagiseni kugamba, Mwana Mnt'hu haswesile udahi mwe isi wo kuwausila want'hu wavu ywawe.” Ivo amgamba yudya aholomp'hale, “Inuka, inula lusazi lwako ukeitile kaya!” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Yudya mnt'hu aholomp'hale akimaalaga na kuita kaya. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Want'hu weze wayaone ayo, weehelagwa na kogoha, niyo wamtogola Mnungu kwa kuwenk'ha want'hu udahi enga uwo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwitanga Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:27-32">Maliko 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu eze ahalawe hadya agendeelaga kulongole, niyo amuona mnt'hu akwitangwa Matayo andaga kekala he nyumba yawe yo uduganyi we kodi. Niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.” Matayo niyo enuka no kumtimila.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu Umwo andaga akadya nk'hande kwe nyumba kwa Matayo, watoza kodi watuhu wabindile ingi, hamwenga na wata wavu watuhu wezaga kwikala hamwenga na wanamp'hina wa Yesu ho ludyo. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo wamwenga weze wayaone ayo, wawauzaga wanamp'hina wakwe kugamba, “Mhinizi ywenyu nii adya na watoza kodi hamwenga na wata wavu?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu awevaga, niyo awahitula, “Mnt'hu heiina maine hakuunga ulaguzi, wanamaine nao akuunga ulaguzi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kehinizeni mwa mawandiko ivo Mnungu ukulonga. Miye naunga mbazi hikuunga malavo. Miye hizile kuwetanga want'hu wedi, mna wata wavu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Swali mwo kufunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Wanamp'hina wa Yohana Mbatizi wamwiziilaga Yesu, niyo wamuuza kugamba, “Suwe na Mafalisayo chafunga. Nii wanamp'hina wako hawakufunga?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu niyo awahitula kugamba, “Havikudahika walalikwe kwe ndoza kufunga wakanda wamwenga no mlombi. Mna aho mlombi akeza kuhalawa mwawe, aho niho nawaungwe kufunga.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Hahana mnt'hu akugela kilaka mwe suke isakale, cheivo kiya kilaka ikihya nekiivutumule kulawa mwe suke iyo isakale, niyo yatenda langa kulu mwe suke iyo. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Naho hahali mnt'hu akugela lude mwe vizembe visakale, cheivo nevitulike niyo ulude ulo lwetika, vizembe ivo navo nevinde vibanika, vituhu vakwe, want'hu wagela lude mhya mwe vizembe vihya, niyo vizembe no uki vanda viikwa vedi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana kike ywa zumbe na mvele mnyonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Umwo Yesu andaga akalonga ivi, mkulu yumwenga ywa Kiyahudi amwiizilaga na kumfikila madi akamgamba, “Mwanangu ywa kivele kabanika haluse ivi, elo so uka mwiikile mikono, naande mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe enukaga niyo waitanya naye. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Aaho, niyo alaila mvele yumwenga andaga akahuma unyonge wakulawa sakame ibuile myaka mlongo na miidi, amtimilaga Yesu niyo adosa imp'hindilo ye suke ya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Alongaga kimoyomoyo kugamba, “Nnadosa du isuke yakwe, nenihone.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu ahitukaga, niyo amuona yudya mvele, niyo amgamba, “Keink'he moyo mwanangu. Mhuwi wako ukuhonya.” Aaho yudya mvele niyo ahona.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu engilaga mwe nyumba ya yudya mkulu. Awabwiilaga want'hu wakuhongeza ndilo <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />niyo awagamba, “Foseni kuse wose! Mwana uyu habanike, kagona du!” Niyo wose wamseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Mna aaho want'hu weze wafose kuse, Yesu engilaga kwe nyumba kudya andaga yudya mndele abanike, amtozaga mkono niyo mndele enuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Imbuli idya yenelaga mwe nt'hendelo zose ze isi idya.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mant'hunt'hu waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu eze ahalawe hadya, no kugendeela kulongole, mant'hunt'hu waidi, wamwiizilaga wakalonga kwa izwi kulu wakagamba, “Mwana Daudi kionele mbalazi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu eze engile, wadya mant'hunt'hu waidi wamtimilaga, niyo awauza kugamba, “Togoleni, mwahuwila kugamba nadaha kuwahonyani?” Niyo wagamba, “Heiye Zumbe, wadaha.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yesu niyo ayatoza meso yawe na kuwagamba, “Nevinde enga viya mhuwile!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meso yawe niyo yaona naho. Yesu niyo awafingiza akawagamba, “Msekumgambila mnt'hu yeyose imbuli ino!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Mna woho weze waite niyo wagendeza zimbuli za Yesu mwe isi idya yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu kimumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Umwo want'hu wandaga wakahalawa, want'hu watuhu wamwigailaga Yesu mnt'hu kimumu kwaviya andaga ana mp'hepo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Mna zimp'hepo izo zize zimfose aaho, mnt'hu yudya niyo akonga kulonga, want'hu wose niyo weehelwa wakagamba, “Hakinati kuviona vint'hu enga ivi mwe Izilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Mna Mafalisayo niyo wagamba, “Alava mp'hepo kwa udahi wa mkulu we zimp'hepo!”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awaonela mbazi want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu azungulukaga mizi yose ne zikaya. Ahinizaga mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila akabilikiza Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Mnungu, naho ahonyaga kila maine na kila manyonge na wose heweekudaha. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Yesu eze ayaone mafyo ya want'hu, awaonelaga mbazi momoyo wakwe kwaviya nawanda wahwele no kuswesa wambizi enga ngoto heziina wadimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ivo niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Ulozo ulozoka, mna wandima wo kuulozola wageke. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Mlombezeni Zumbe wo ulozo, vileke egale wavuni wo ulozo wakwewagilwa wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Wana mp'hina mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu awetangaga wanamp'hina wakwe mlongo na waidi hamwenga, awenk'ha udahi wa kugulusa mp'hepo no kuhonya want'hu maine yawe, na wose heweekukedaha. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Yano nayo amazina ya wegala ulosi mlongo na waidi wa Yesu nk'hongo ni Simoni akwitangwa Petulo, na Anduleya nduguye na Yakobo mwanawe Zebedayo na Yohana nduguye, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomayo, Tomasi na Matayo andaga mkusanya kodi. Yakobo mwana Alufayo na Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni mkaya mtoanila isi na Yuda Isikaliyote, yudya amsezengaga Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awasigila wadya wasigilwa mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7">Maliko 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu niyo awasigila wadya wasigilwa mlongo na waidi, niyo awagamba, “Msekuita kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi, naho msekwingila mwo mzi wowose wa Kisamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ivedi vakwe, mziitile zingoto zagile za want'hu wa Izilaeli <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Iteni mkabilikize kugamba, Useuta wa Mnungu wihagihi. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Honyeni wanyonge, uyuleni want'hu, wasunt'heni wata matana, laveni mp'hepo mwa want'hu. Mwink'higwa haheina maliho laveni haheina maliho. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Msekwinula zahabu, hela, hegu shaba mwemifuko yenyu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Msekwinula mifuko ya kulombezela vint'hu mwe nt'hambo, naho mse kuguha suke ya kusakanya, hegu vilatu, hegu ngoda. Wandima wawagilwa kwinkwa kiya wakuunga.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Umwo mkaita mwe zikaya na mwe mizi, ingileni mkaule yeyose akuunga amitendeleni kise. Ikaleni kwakwe mpaka aho mkuunga mhalawe. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Mkengila mwe nyumba, wagambeni, Utondowazi nounde mwa nyuwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Uneva want'hu we nyumba iyo wana watendelani kise, ndamsa iyo yo utondowazi, neisigale nawo, hawana tendile ivo, ndamsa yenyu nemiuiyeni. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Naho want'hu wanaleka kuwatendela kise mwo mzi hegu mwe kaya yoyose, halaweni aho, naho mkahalawa, kungunt'heni no luvumbi lumwe viga venyu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, mzi uwo noupate masulumizo makulu kujink'ha masulumizo yawapataga want'hu we mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masulumizo yakwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Kauliseni, miye nawasigiilani uko kuse enga ngoto mwe nyika ya mauzi. Mwaungwa mnde wabala enga nyoka, naho mnde wajalamu enga suwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Indeni na wengele, kwaviya nawa wavugaileni, niyo ywawegala kwe vitala vawe, nomtoigwe ngoda mwezi nyumba zawe zo kuvikila. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Nomwigalwe kwe vitala va wakulu we isi na mazumbe kwa ajili yangu, enga ulonga uwona kwa woho na want'hu wose hi Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Umwo wakawegalani kwe vitala, msekufanyanya fanyanya ivo mkuunga mlonge. Nomwink'higwe yo kulonga Umwo mkaungwa ukulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwaviya yadya mkunga mlonge hiyo ya kwenyu nyuwe, mna nayalawe kwa Muye ywa Mnungu akuunga alonge kombokela kwa nyuwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Mnt'hu namsezenge nduguye vileke akomigwe, iviya iviya welesi wakigosi nawawasezenge wana wawe vileke wakomigwe. Wana nao nawasaguke kwa welesi wawe, niyo wawakoma. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Want'hu wose na wawaihiyeni kwaviya mwanitimila, mna akuunga afinyilize no mpaka kwo uheelo, niye akuunga ahone.<verse eid="MAT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />“Wakakusunk'ha sunk'ha mwo mzi umwenga sumkila hatuhu. Nawagambilani ikindedi kugamba hombinde mizi yose ya Izilaeli mpaka aho mwana mt'hu akei abule<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mwanamp'hina hakudaha kunda mkulu kumjink'ha mhinizi ywakwe, mtumwa naye hakudaha kunda mkulu kujink'ha zumbe ywakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Vakint'ha mwanamp'hina aligane na mhinizi ywakwe, na mtumwa naye kuligana na zumbe dyakwe. Uneva mkulu we nyumba ketangwa Belizebuli, wana we inyumba iyo nawenk'higwe mazina yaihise?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niani wo kogoha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ivo mse kuwogoha want'hu kwaviya chochose kikefisile nekivumbuke, na kiya kimwe kinyele nekilawile kuse. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Diya huunga niwa gambileni mwo lwiza, nyuwe mwaungwa mdilonge kungaile, na diya mkuunga mgambilwe kwe nyumba, nyuwe dilongeleni kwe hant'hu henuke hakumvikila Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Use kwogoha wakuukoma umwili niyo wadunduga kuukoma umuye. Nivedi mna mogoha akukoma umwili, akajika naho akoma no umuye mwo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Togoleni, mbayuwayu imwenga haikutagwa kwa hela imwenga? Naho haikudaha kugwa imwenga haheina mzungu wa Tati yenyu <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Mna nyuwe, zifili zenyu ze mitwi yenyu ziwazigwa zose. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Elo nyuwe msekogoha, nyuwe mwafaha kujink'ha zimbayu wayu zinyingi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzumila no kumlemela Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Kwaviya wakuunga wanizumile miye mwe kiyeti cha want'hu kugamba miye niywawe, miye name neniwatendele iivo mwa ameso ya Tate ekulanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Mna akuunga ananilemele mwe kieti, name neni mlemele mwa ameso ya Tate e kulanga<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higala nk'hondo higale muivano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mnase mgambe hiza kwigala mwivano mwe isi. Bule. Hizile kwigala utondowazi, higala nk'hondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Hiza kuwachakulani wanakilume na wa Tati zawe, wanakivele na wamami zawe, mwana kike na nine vyala. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Naho wank'hondo wa mnt'hu nawalawe mwe mp'huga yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Wose wawaungise wamamizawe na watatizawe kujink'ha kuniunga miye, hawawagilwe kunda wanamp'hina wangu. Wadya nawo wakuwaungisa wana wawe, hawawagilwe kunda wanamp'hina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Hewekudaha kwinula viwambilo vawe niyo wanitimila mwezi sila zangu, hawawagilwe kunda wanamp'hina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Wakuunga wageze kongezela ugima ywawe, nawawaze, mna wakuunga kuwaza ugimawawe kwa kuni zungula miye, nawongezelwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mageleko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Akuwahokelani nyuwe, anihokela miye, naho akunihokela miye amhokela yehe anitumile. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Akuunga amhokele mlotezi we mbuli ya Mnungu, naahokele iviya viwagilwe ulotezi ywakwe, naho akumhokela mnt'hu ywedi, mwo uwagilwa wakwe naahokele viwagile uwedi wa uyo kwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Naho namigambilani kindedi, mnt'hu yeyose akuunga amwink'he yumwenga mwa awa wakunitimila kiyamp'ha cha mazi yahoile kwaviya ni mwanamp'hina ywangu, naahokele mageleko.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Wegazi wo ulosi wa Yohana Mbatizi kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Aho Yesu eze ajinke kuwenk'ha mwiko wanamp'hina wakwe wadya mlongo na waidi, ahalawaga hadya niyo agenda kubilikiza kwe mizi ihagihi na hadya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohana Mbatizi uko kwe divugailo, evaga zimbuli izo Kilisito naakadamanya, niyo awatuma wamwenga mwa wanamp'hina wakwe kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Niyo wamgamba, “Kigambile, weye niweye chagambilwe ni Yohana Mbatizi kugamba weza, hegu kikawiile mtuhu?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu awahitulaga kugamba, “Uyeni mkamgambile Yohana aya mkuyaona na kuyeva, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Mant'hunt'hu waona, viwete vagenda, wata matana wakukizwa, viziwi weva, wabanike wauyulwa, naho Mbuli Yedi ya Mnungu, yabilikizwa kwa want'hu wakiwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Nawande na kinyemi kwa wadya wose wakuunga waike mhuwi kwangu!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Umwo wanamp'hina wa Yohana wandaga wakauya, Yesu akongaga kulonga no mdugano akawauza kugamba, “Viya kudya kwenyika mwaitaga, mwagendaga kukaulai? Mwakawiilaga kuonai? Lunyazi lukuvesulwa ni Muye? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Mwagendaga kukaulai? Mnt'hu availe suke za kiseuta? Mnt'hu akuvala enga ivo ahumula mwe zinyumba ze kiseuta! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Nigambileni, nomgenda kukaulai? Mlotezi? Kindedi, naho kujink'ha mlotezi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Kwaviya Yohana niye alongagwa mwe mawandiko kugamba, nenigale mwigala mbuli akuunga akulongoele, uyo akuunga akomole isila yako. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nawagambilani ikindedi kugamba, Yohana Mbatizi ni mkulu kujink'ha wose walailaga. Mna yeyose emdodo mwo useuta wa kulanga, ni mkulu kumjika Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kukongela aho Yohana Mbatizi andaga akabilikiza mpaka mwa mazuwa aya ya dielo, Useuta wa kwe mbingu wapatikana kwa ludole, naho wata ludole nawo wakuutaha. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kwaviya mahinizo yose ya walotezi ne miko ya Musa, yalotelaga mpaka mwa Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Naho uneva mwadaha kuzumila, uyu Yohana niye yudya Eliya aungigwe eze. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Mta magutwi, neeve!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Haluse, want'hu wa dielo niwaliganyize na mbwai? Wekala enga wana wakwikala hedigwilo, kawetanga weyawe, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />Kimtoelani ngoma mna hamuungile kuvina, naho kimkemelani mila ya kuhongeza mna hamuungile kuhongeza! <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Umwo Yohana ezaga, hadyaga naho hanywele mp'hombe, niyo wamgamba, ana mp'hepo! <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Umwo Mwana Mnt'hu eze eze, adyaga no kunywa mazi ye zabibu, niyo wamgamba mhank'hu naho mkozi, ana uhamwenga na want'hu wakutoza ushusulu mwa want'hu na want'hu watuhu wavu, kwavovose, mzungu wa Mnungu nouoneka kunda kindedi, vilawane ne zindima zakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi heiikuhuwila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Want'hu we mizi idya Yesu adamanyisaga vihungi, hawaungaga kuleka wavu wawe, vatendaga Yesu awativile.<verse eid="MAT 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Hangi we mwenye, Kolazini! Hangi we mwenye, Betisaida! Yandile vihungi vidamanywe kwenyu vadamanywe Tilo na Sidoni, want'hu wakwe hegu nawakweiila kale, wakavala magunia, kulagisa kugamba, waleka wavu wawe. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, nyuwe nomsulumiziswe kujink'ha weenyu wa Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Weye nawe Kapelinaumu, waunga ukekweze we mwenye kulanga! Nouselezwe mpaka kwe isi ya want'hu wabanike. Uneva vihungi vidamanywe kwenyu vadamanywe Sodoma, mzi uwo hegu nounda aaho hata ivi dielo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Manyiseni kugamba, mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo Mnungu naauonele mbalazi Sodoma, kujink'ha nyuwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nitimileni miye, niwahumuzeni.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Aho Yesu niyo agamba, “Nakutogola Tate, Zumbe ywa Kulanga ne isi. Nakutogola kwaviya mbuli izi kuwafisa wata umanyi na mizungu niyo wawagubuila want'hu wakembe. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Heiye Tate ivi nivo uungile vinde.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Hink'higwa vose ni Tate. Hahali ammanyize Umwana, hegu Tate, naho hahali ammanyize Tate ila Mwana na yeyose yudya Mwana aungile kumlavanyila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Soni kwangu nyose mzamilwe ni nt'wika zenyu, miye neni wahumuzeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Kekakeni kifungo changu, naho hineni kwangu kwaviya miye ni mjalamu naho hikeseleza, nanywe nomnde na kinyemi mwe mioyo yenyu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwaviya, mbuli huunga niwenk'heni nyuwe mpufu, ne nt'wika huunga niwatwikeni, ihuha.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Zuwa dyo Kuhumula ni kint'hu chani?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Mwe mazuwa yadya, Yesu andaga akagenda kombokela mwe nk'honde imwenga ya ngano mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula. Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakeiva sala, niyo wakonga kukwanyula fundo ye ngano na kukonga kuyadya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayo weze wayaone ayo, niyo wamgamba Yesu, “Kaula ivo wakutenda wanamp'hina wako, wabananga Miko. Hivo vedi kutenda ivo mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe hamsomile ivo Daudi atendaga viya yehe hamwenga na wadya want'hu viya andaga na sala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wengilaga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, yehe na weyawe, niyo wadya imikate ilavigwe kwe mbuli ya Mnungu, hamwenga na kugamba hachandaga kint'hu chedi kwa woho kuidya, kwaviya wawagilwe kuidya na walava nt'hambiko aawo du. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Hegu naho nyuwe hamsomile mwe miko ya Musa kugamba kila zuwa dye Kuhumula walava nt'hambiko mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, wabanangaga miko imwenga, naho hawa kuwazilwa wavu? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, kiyaha kikulu kikujink'ha Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Iwandikwa, naungisa mbazi, hikuungisa nt'hambiko. Wandile mwaumanyize ulosi uno vedi, hegu homka wasengela want'hu heweina masa. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kwaviya, Mwana Mnt'hu niye Zumbe we zuwa dyo Kuhumula.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu aholomp'hale mkono</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu ahalawaga hadya, niyo aita kwe nyumba ya kuvikila. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Uko kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga aholomp'halaga mkono. Naho handaga na want'hu waungaga wamgele Yesu mwa masa. Niyo wamuuza, “Hivo vedi mwe Miko yetu kumhonya mnt'hu mwe dizuwa dye Kuhumula?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu niyo awahitula kugamba, “Togoleni, niani mwa nyuwe mta ngoto ingile mwe digenge, heekudaha kuilava mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Naho mnt'hu ni ugoli utendedese kujink'ha ngoto. Naivo elo, mwe Zimiko hazikukifingiza kudamanya yedi mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Niyo amgamba yudya aholomp'hale mkono, “Chulula mkono wako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Niyo auchululaga mkono wakwe, niyo wanda mgima enga udya umtuhu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Mafalisayo wamlekaga, niyo wagenda kuluka mizungu yo kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima asagulwe ni Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu eze eve mizungu yo kumkoma, niyo ahalawa hadya, mna fyo kulu dya want'hu dya mtimilaga. Awahonyaga wose wandaga wakalumwa, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />naho awasigiilaga kugamba, wasekugambila want'hu watuhu zimbuli zakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Atendaga ivi vileke yadya alongaga Mnungu kombokela kwa mlotezi Isaya yakint'he.<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Niye mtumwa ywangu nimsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">niye nimuungise naho hyelelwa naye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nenimgele Muye ywangu mwakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Mbuli yo usengelo wangu naaigendeze kwa want'hu wose.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Haande mnk'hani naho haagutile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">naho haaile kwa izwi kulu mwe zibalabala.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Haavune mnuli ugolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">naho lumuli lukufunk'ha mosi haaluzime</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Naande aaho mpaka aulete usengelo wo uwagilwa inde na uhumi,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />naho mwa yehe, want'hu wose nawande na kawiilo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu no mkulu we mp'hepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Naho kwandaga na want'hu yumwenga andaga mant'hunt'hu wamwigalaga kwa Yesu. Naho hakudaha kulonga kwaviya andaga na mp'hepo. Yesu amhonyaga mnt'hu yudya niyo anda mgima niyo adaha kulonga na kukaula. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mafyo ya want'hu weehelwagwa kwa yadya adamanyaga Yesu. Niyo wakeuzauza kugamba, “Ivi uyu hiyo Mwana Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Mafalisayo weze ivo, niyo wahitula kugamba, “Uyu alava mp'hepo kwaviya Belizebuli amwink'ha udahi wa kudamanya ivo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu ayamanyaga yose yadya nawakadamanya, niyo awahitula kugamba, “Useuta wowose ukukepanga vifyo, vikutoana venye kwa venye, haikwikalisa. Naho uneva mzi, hegu lukolo lolose lukukepanganiza mwe vifyo, vikutoana venye kwa venye, lukolo ulo nolugwe <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ivo uneva mwo useuta wa Mwavu, kila kafyo katoana na keyawe, nuko kugamba, uzumbe uwo ukepanga, naho nousunguze ukugwa! <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Nyuwe mwagamba miye nalava mp'hepo kwaviya Belizebuli anink'ha udahi wo kudamanya ivo. Vedi, haluse niani akuwenk'ha wanamp'hina wenyu udahi wo kulava mp'hepo? Kiya wakudamanya wanamp'hina wenyu, nichokikuwasengelani kugamba mwi wavu! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Bule! Hiyo mkulu ywa mp'hepo, mna Muye ywa Mnungu niye akunink'ha udahi wa kuzilava mp'hepo. Naivo kulavanya kugamba, Useuta wa Mnungu uweziilani kale.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Hahali yeyose akudaha kumola nyumba ya mta udahi, niyo aguha vint'hu vakwe, mpaka ande kumkakakiliza mta umdahi uyo, niho adahe kuitaha inyumba iyo.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Mnt'hu yeyose hehamwenga na miye uyo anitowa nk'hodo, naho heekuduganya na miye, uyo amwaganisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Naivo nawagambilani, want'hu nawausilwe wavu wowose na wiihi wowose wakunga wamlongele Mnungu. Mna mnt'hu akuunga amlongele yaihile Muye ywa Mnungu, haausilwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Naho mnt'hu yeyose akuunga alonge dyodyose diihile kwa mwana mnt'hu, adaha kuusilwa wiihi uwo, mna akuunga ayalonge yaihile kwa Muye ywa Mnungu, haausilwe wavu uwo kukongela ivi haluse, na mazuwa yakwiza.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kila mti ne cheleko chakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Mti wedi neweleke matunda yedi, mti wiihile nawo neweleke matunda yaihile. Naho kila mti nemanyike mwe cheleko chakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nyuwe cheleko cha mazoka! Mwadaha vivihi kulonga mbuli zedi mna nyuwe enye mwiha? Kwaviya mnomo walonga kiya kimemeze umoyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mnt'hu ywedi alava mbuli zedi kulawa mwe kindolo che vint'hu vedi, aihile naye alava vint'hu viihile kulawa mwe kindolo che vint'hu viihile.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Mwikale mkamanya kugamba, mwedizuwa dyo usengelo, kila yumwenga naaungwe kulava ikindedi cha kila ulosi wiihile aulongile. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwaivo kwe milosi yako nousengelwe kulumizwa, naho kwe milosi yako nousengelwe kuhozwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waunga kuwona vilagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Niyo wahinizi wamwenga we zimiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo niyo wamgamba, “Mhinizi, chaunga ukilagise vilagiso.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu niyo ahita akagamba, “Cheleko cha uhabwasi kiihile chazungula vilagiso, du hekink'higwe vilagiso, ila vilagiso va mlotezi Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Enga viya Yona ekalaga mazuwa matatu mwe diifu dye nyangumi, Mwana Mnt'hu nivo neekale mwo moyo we isi mazuwa matatu kilo na msi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, want'hu wa Ninawi nawakimale hamwenga ne cheleko iki, naho nawakisegele kunda na wiihi. Kwaviya wamtegelazaga Yona niyo waleka wavu wawe. Nawagambilani ikindedi kugamba, kiyaho kikulu kumjink'ha Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, mke zumbe ywa kumosi naakimale na kuwagela mwo usengelo wo wiihi wenyu, kwaviya agendaga kulawa hale kwiza kwiva mzungu wa Sulemani. Naho aha eyaho mkulu kumjink'ha Sulemani!<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuiwa ni mp'hepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Mp'hepo ikamfosa mnt'hu, yombokela mwe isi inyaile ikazungula ho kwikala. Uneva ina swesa, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />yagamba, ‘Neniuye kwe nyumba yangu.’ Naivo yauya, niyo inabwiila inyumba idya haina chochose, ihagilwa naho ihambwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Ivo neiite kuse niyo yawaguha weyawe watuhu mfungate waihile kujink'ha yoho yenye, niyo zeza kwikala mwo mt'hu uyo. Umwo zikekala mwo mnt'hu uyo. Uyo mnt'hu anda na hali iihise kujink'ha idya ya nk'hogo. Ivo nivo vikuunga vilaile, mwa awant'hu awa awavu wa mazuwa aya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nine na wanduguze dya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Umwo nine na wanduguze wamwizilaga, Yesu andaga akagendeela kulonga na want'hu. Woho wakimaalaga kuse kwaviya waungaga walonge naye. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ivo mwanamp'hina ywakwe yumwenga niyo amgamba, “Nyokwe na wanduguzo wakimala kuse, waunga walonge na weye.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu niyo awahitula kugamba, “Wandugu zangu ni wahi? Naho mnala niani?”<verse eid="MAT 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Niyo aloloteza kwa wanamp'hina wakwe niyo agamba, “Kauleni awa nao wandugu zangu, naho nao wamnala. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Mnt'hu yeyose akutenda yakumuwagila Tate ywa kwe mbingu, uyo niye lumbu dyangu naho niye ndugu yangu naho niye mnala.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Umliganyizo wo mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Mwe dizuwa idia, Yesu ahalawaga hadya he nyumba, niyo aita nt'hendelo ya kwe diziwa. Uko ekalaga hasi niyo akonga kuhiniza. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mafyo makulu ya want'hu yamzungulukaga, valekaga akengila mwe ngalawa niyo ekala uumo, mna ayo amafyo yandaga mnk'handa mwe diziwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ahinizaga mbuli zibindile ingi kwa miliganyizo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Kwandaga na mnt'hu agendaga kumyaga mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Umwo andaga akamyaga zimbeyu zimwenga zatomokaga mwe sila, niyo zadondolwa ni videge. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Zimwenga zatomokaga mwo luwe mwandaga na msanga mgeke. Mbeyu zia niyo zanyuluka, kwaviya msanga nounda mgeke. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Mna zuwa dize dyalike, niyo dyazoka zimbeyu zihotile, naho kwaviya maizi yakwe hayengilisaga hasi, mbeyu ziya zihotile niyo zanyuluka. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu zimwenga zatomokelaga mwe miwamba ngoma yakulisaga, niyo yazivigaviga zimbeyu izo zihotile. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Mna mbeyu zimwenga nezitomokela mwo ulongo wedi, niyo zimwenga zeleka mp'huluzi gana, zimwenga milongo mtandatu, imwenga milongo mitatu kujink'ha viya zahandagwa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mta magutwi yo kwivila neeve!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimtendile Yesu akahiniza kwa miliganyizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Wanamp'hina wakwe wezaga wakamuuza, “Nii wahiniza kwa miliganyizo umwo ukalonga na want'hu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu awahitulaga akawagamba, “Nyuwe mwink'higwa kumanya kinyele cho umanyi we vint'hu vo Useuta wa Mnungu, mna hiyo woho.” <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwaviya kila mta kint'hu neenk'higwe vituhu no kongezelwa, vileke ande navo vikumkint'ha. Mna heiina kint'hu, naahokigwe hata kiya ikidodo ana nacho. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Vikuleka hahiniza kwa miliganyizo umwo halonga nao, ni kwaviya, wakaula mna hawakuona, wategeleza mna hawa kwiva, naho hawa kukombaganya. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ivo yadya alongile mlotezi Isaya yakint'ha kwawe kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kutegeleza nomtegeleze mna homkombaganye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kukaula nomkaule mna homuwone.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kwaviya mioyo yawe midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">naho wayasita magutwi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na meso yawe wafinya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Hegu nawakaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">naho hegu naweva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">hegu nawakombaganya mwo ubala wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">no kunihitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">name hegu nehiwahonya.<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Mna kwa nyuwe mna kinyemi kwaviya meso yenyu yaona magutwi yenyu nayo yeva. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nawagambilani kindedi, walotezi na want'hu wengi wedi nawaungisa kuyaona ayo nyuwe mkuyaona, mna wadundugaga, nokwiva aya nyuwe mkwiva, mna hawadahaga.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atambalisa mliganyizo wo mhandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Tegelezeni naho mhine mliganyizo wo mhandi ivo ukulonga. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Wose wadya wakuitegeleza mbuli yo useuta wa Mnungu, mna niyo hawakuukombaganya, awa wekala enga ziya zimbeyu zatomokaga mwe sila. Mwavu niyo eza no kuzingola ziya zimyagigwe mwawe. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ziya zimbeyu zitomokele mwo luwe, ni enga wadya wakuhokela mbuli ya Mnungu kwa kinyemi, aaho wakeza kuiva du. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Mna haikwingilisa mwe mioyo yawe, naho haikwikalisa, naivo wabwiilana na masulumizo na magezo yakaweziila kwe mbuli idya wahokele, wauya kunyuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Zimbeyu ziya zigweele mwe miwambangoma, zakeiga na wadya wose wakuiva mbuli ya Mnungu, wogofi wo wikazi mwe isi, hamwenga nokuungisa ugoli, wazinganiza imbuli niyo waswesa kweleka. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Naho mbeyu ziya zitomokele mwo ulongo wedi zakimala hant'hu ha wadya wakuiva imbuli ya Mnungu no kuikombaganya, naivo ukweleka mp'huluzi, imwenga kwa gana, imwenga milongo mtandatu, nt'huhu milongo mitatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Niyo Yesu awagambila mliganyizo mtuhu. “Useuta wa Mnungu wikala enga ivi. Mnt'hu ahandaga mbeyu yedi mwo mgunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Mna zuwa dimwenga nekilo want'hu wagonile, mwiihi ezaga niyo ahanda mani matuhu mwe nk'honde idya ihandigwe ingano niyo ahalawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Mbeyu izo zize zikule no kukonga kugela fundo, mani nayo niyo yakelaviliza. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Niho wandima wakwe wamwiizila no kumgamba, Zumbe, hwa handile mbeyu zedi mwe nk'honde yako? Mani matuhu yalawa nahi? <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Zumbe niyo ahitula, Mwavu niye adamanye ivi, wandima niyo wamuuza, waunga kikayangole mani yadya? <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Yudya zumbe niyo awahitula, bule, mnase mng'ole hamwenga ne ingano, kwaviya vi hamwenga. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Lekeni zikulanye, vibule mwokuvunwa, aho niho neniwagambe wavuni, yandeni kung'ola mani matuhu, niyo mwayalunja hamwenga mwe vichanga yokwe moto. Mkajika, ingano igeleni kwe digulu dyangu. ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we mbeyu ye haladali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu niyo awagambila mliganyizo mtuhu. “Useuta wa Mnungu, wikala enga ivi. Mnt'hu akuguha kabeyu kadodo vitendese niyo aihanda mwo mgunda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ni kabeyu kadodo kujink'ha mbeyu zose, mna kanakula, dyanda ziti kulu kujink'ha miti yose. Dyanda ziti dikutenda madege yeze no kuzenga vyaila vawe mwa matambi yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo ugwadu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu awagambila mliganyizo mtuhu. “Useuta wa kulanga wikala enga viya mvele akuguha ugwadu no kuugela mwe mpishi nt'hatu za unga, niyo wagwaduka wose.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agela miliganyizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliko 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu niyo awagambilaga want'hu zimbuli zose kwa miliganyizo. Halongaga dyodyose kwa want'hu haheina miliganyizo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Atendaga ivi kutenda yadya alongaga mlotezi yakint'he,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Neniloge kwa miliganyizo Umwo halonga na woho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">neniwagambile mbuli heziimanyike kukongela aho ho kuumbigwa isi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atambalisa mliganyizo wo mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yesu eze awalage awant'hu no kwingila kwe nyumba, wanamp'hina wakwe nawamuitila no kumgamba, “Kigambile, mliganyizo wa mani mo mgunda, nivo wagaaze?”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Mhandi we mbeyu izedi ni Mwana ywa Mnungu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />mgunda ni isi, mbeyu izedi ni want'hu wo Useuta, mani ni wadya want'hu wa Mwavu. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mwavu ahandile zimbeyu ziihile ni Mwavu, uvuni nounde mwo kusila kwe isi, wavuni ni mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Enga viya va mani matuhu yakulunganywa no kokigwa mwo moto, kint'hu enga icho nekilaile kwe dizuwa dyo kusila isi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana Mnt'hu naawegale mtumigwa ywakwe no kuwaduganya wose wekuse yo Useuta wakwe, na wose wawatendile want'hu wadamanye wavu, na wose wakudamanya mbuli ziihile. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu wa Mnungu nawawaduule mwo moto. Uko nawaile no kugwagwajula meno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Naho wadya want'hu wedi nawang'ale enga zuwa kwo Useuta wa Tati yawe. Mta magutwi ya kwivila neeve!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we kindolo kikefisile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Useuta wa kulanga ukeiga na mnt'hu akuzungula kindolo kifisigwe mwo mgunda. Eze akione, kwa kinyemi niyo agenda kutaga vint'hu vose andile navo niyo eza kuugula umgunda udya.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa kint'hu cha ugoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Naho useuta wa kulanga ukeiga na mnt'hu akuzungula kint'hu cha ugoli, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />naho eze avumbuze iyedi heina ya kuligana nayo, agendaga kutaga vose viya andaga navo, niyo aigula.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo ulwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Naho Useuta wa kulanga ukeiga na lwavu wa samaki waduulaga lwavu lwawe mwe diziwa niyo wagwila zisamaki zi hengi. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Lwavu lwize lumeme, nawaluvuta kuse ye bahali, wazisagule zi samaki zia izedi wazigela mwe zint'hangulu, na zia ziihile waziduula. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ivi nivo nevinde mwe dizuwa dyo kusila isi mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu nawawaduganye want'hu awavu kulawa mwa awant'hu awedi, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />naho nawaduulwe mwe nunda ina moto. Uko nokunde ndilo na kugwegwejula meno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikindedi ikihya ne kiya cha kale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Togoleni mwayakombaganya aya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Niyo wamhitula, “Heiye,”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ivo niyo awahitula, “Uku nukugamba, kila mhinizi wa Miko ukunda mwanamp'hina mwo Useuta wa kulanga, naande enga yudya mta nyumba aguile ivint'hu ivihya na kuviusa viya va kale mwe nyumba yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Nazaleti wamlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu eze abinde kuwagambila imiliganyizo iyo, ahalawaga hadya <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />nokuuya kwawe kaya. Ahinizaga mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, naho wose wadya wamwivile weheelagwa. Wauzaga, “Uyu kaulavahi umanyi enga uno? Na udamanyi wa udahi enga uno? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Uyu hiye mwana ywa selemala? Nine hi Maliamu, naho wanduguze hi awa wakina Yakobo, na Yusufu, na Simoni, na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Walumbuze wose hawa kwikala aaha? Yano yose kayapata hi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Elo niyo wamlemela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mlotezi naahokelwe hohose ila hiyo kwawe kaya, na mwe nyumba yawe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Kwaviya hawana mhuwi, hakudaha kudamanya vihungi vingi aho.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">File ya Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Helode zumbe ywa Galilaya azivaga zimbuli za Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Uyo ni Yohana Mbatizi auyuke! Nivo vikuleka ana udahi wa kudamanya vihungi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Kwaviya helode asiigilaga kugamba Yohana agwilwe niyo akakilizwe mp'hingu na kuvugailwa kwedivugailwe, adamanyaga ivo kwe mbuli ya Helodiya mkaziwe dya mkuluwe Filipo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwaviya zuwa dimwenga, Yohana Mbatizi amgambaga Helode, “Hivo vedi kwa weye kumlomba Helodia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode aungaga amkome mna andaga akawogoha Wayahudi Kwaviya wammanyaga kugamba andaga mlotezi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mwe dizuwa dyo wila wokukumbukila ukwelekwa kwakwe Helode, mwanawe we kivele etangwe Helodiya avinaga mwe kieti cha want'hu wose. Helode elelwaga vidala uvini wo mwanawe <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />vilekile akamgamba, “nilombeze chochose name nohwink'he!”<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Kwa kusongelezwa ni nine, amgambaga ise, “Nink'he haluse ivi umtwi wa Yohana Mbatizi mwo lwiga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Zumbe azimilagwa, mna kwa kuwogoha wadya wandaga aho wevaga akalonga no mwanawe, niyo asigiila kugamba yudya mwana kike enk'higwe viya aungile. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Yohana niyo akant'wa umtwi kudya kwe divugailo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Umtwi niyo wageligwa mwe kaziga niyo enk'higwa yudya mwana kike, naye niyo amwigaila nine. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Wanamp'hina wa Yohana wezaga kuuguha umwili wa Yohana no kuumosa msanga, niyo wagenda kumgambila Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awenk'ha nk'hande difyo dya want'hu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu eze eve zimbuli za Yohana ahalawaga hadya mwe ingalawa niyo aita hant'hu hakiikeike, want'hu wamwivaga, niyo wamtimila kulawa kwe kaya lwaviga. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu niyo afosa mwe ngalawa, naho eze auone mdugano mkulu, nakawaonela mbazi awant'hu, awahonyaga wose wandaga wakalumwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Mwalagulo ludya wanamp'hina wakwe wamwizilaga niyo wamgamba, “Zuwa diswa na uku ki kwe nyika. Walage awant'hu waite wakakezunguile nk'hande.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Hevidahike want'hu awa wahalawe, wenk'heni nyuwe cho kudya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Niyo wamhitula, “Aha suwe kina visamaki vishano du na vebesu viidi va mikate.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Hake vinink'heni.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Awagambaga want'hu wekale hasi mwa mani, niyo aguha mikate idya imishano ne visamaki viidi. Niyo akaula kulanga, niyo amtogola Mnungu, aibendulaga migate idya, niyo awenk'ha wanamp'hina, wanamp'hina nawo niyo wawapasila awant'hu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Kila yumwenga adyaga, niyo eguta. Wana mp'hina wakwe waduganyaga nt'hangulu mlongo na mbili zimemile vibesu visigale. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Want'hu wadyaga ludyo ulo wandaga gana milongo mishano wagosi awo du, kuleka wavele, na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agenda mnanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe wengile mwe ngalawa, naho walongole kuita gundi ye diziwa Umwo yehe andaga akawalaga awant'hu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Eze abinde kuwalaga, aitaga komnima ekedu kugenda kumlombeza Mnungu. Kwize kunde mwalagulo Yesu andaga ekedu. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Naho mwo lupisi ulo ngalawa yandaga hale mwediziwa, ikajubwaniswa kwaviya kwandaga na nk'hung'unto yandaga ikaihingamila ingalawa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ize ibuze kilo cha gati ya saa kane na saa mtandatu, Yesu awabasaga wanamp'hina wakwe akagenda mwa amazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Weze amuone akagenda mwa amazi, niyo wogoha wakagamba, “Iki kizuli!” Niyo waguta kwa kogoha.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Mna aho Yesu niyo awagamba, “Keink'heni moyo, ni miye. Msekogoha!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Zumbe uneva ni weye nigambe nize uko nigende mwa mazi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “So.” Petulo niyo aseela mwe ngalawa no kugenda mwa amazi akambasa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Mna eze aone nk'hun'gunto, niyo ogoha no kukonga kudubwila mwa mazi niyo aguta, “Zumbe niyokole!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Aho niyo Yesu amtoza no umkono wakwe na kumgamba, “Weye uhungukilwe mhuwi, nii kunda muoga?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Naho Umwo weze wengile mwe ingalawa, nk'hung'unto niyo wanyamala. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Niyo wose wandaga mwe ingalawa niyo wamvika wakagamba, “Kindedi weye niwe mwana Mnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mnyonge mwe Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Weze womboke idiziwa, niyo wabula mwe isi ya Genezaleti, <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />want'hu wa hadya weze wabunk'hule kugamba niyehe, niyo wagambilana wose, hamwenga na wanyonge wawegalaga kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Niyo wamlombeza kugamba wadose du zimp'hindo ze isuke yakwe, naho wose watendaga ivo wahonaga kindedi.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mahinizo ya wakale</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Naho mafalisayo wamwenga na wahinizi we zisigiizi wezaga kulawa Yelusalemu wakamuuza Yesu kugamba, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Nii wanamp'hina wako hawakutimila mahinizo ya wakale wetu? Hawa kuhaka mazi mwe mikono enga viya vikuungwa wakaunga wadye!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nii nanywe hakutimila miko ya Mnungu mna mwatimila mahinizo yenyu nyuwe wenye? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwaviya Mnungu agambaga, wogoheni watati zenyu na wamami zenyu, naho akuunga amhomole nine hegu ise hata kukomigwa akomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Mna nyuwe mwahiniziza kugamba uneva mnt'hu ananacho cha kumwambiza ise hegu nine mna agamba, kint'hu iki cha Mnungu, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />havikuungwa amogohe ise. Kwa ivi muihitula imiko ya Mnungu, vileke mtimile mahinizo yenyu enye. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Watondwe nyuwe! Isaya awalotelaga vedi aho akagamba,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Want'hu awa wanivika kimnomo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">mna mioyo yawe ihale na miye.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Wanivika bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">kwaviya wahiniziza mahinizo ya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">enga kugamba ni miko yangu! ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vint'hu vikumgela mnt'hu usavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu niyo awitanga umdugano, niyo awagamba “Tegelezani naho mkombaganye. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Hiyo kiya kikumwingila mnt'hu kwo mnomo kimtende ande msavu, mna kukifosa mo mnomo uwo nicho kikumtenda ande msavu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamwizila wakamgamba, “Kuvimanya kugamba Mafalisayo wank'hondo wa kwe milosi yako?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Niyo yehe ahitula kugamba, “Ziti dyodyose hedihandigwe ni Tate e kulanga nedi ng'oligwe na maizi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Msekuwogoha Kwaviya awo ni vilongozi mant'hunt'hu, uneva kilongozi mant'hunt'hu amlongoza mant'hunt'hu miyawe wose waidi nawahubugile mwedibome.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Kigambile vedi umliganyizo uno.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Nanywe mkei kunda wabala du? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Hamkukombaganya kugamba, kikwingila kwo mnomo chaita kwezinda, niyo chafosela kuse. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Mna kikulawa mwo mnomo chalawa kwo moyo naho iki chamgela mnt'hu usavu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwaviya kwo moyo kwalawa fanyanyi ziihile, zikwigala ukomi, uhabwasi, na mbuli nt'huhu za mwo mwili, finju, udant'hi, na kuhomola. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Yano yose nayo yakumgela mnt'hu usavu, mna hiyo kudya haheina kuhaka mikono kukumtenda mnt'hu ande msavu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvele mta mhuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu ahalawaga hadya niyo aita kwe isi hagihi ne mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mvele yumwenga wa Kanani amwizilaga akamgamba, “Yesu mwana Daudi! Niyonele mbazi Zumbe! Mwanangu wa kike ana mp'hepo, naho yamgela kiyangayanga yanga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Mna Yesu hamhitulaga dyodyose. Wanamp'hina wakwe wamwizilaga, niyo wamgamba, “Mgambe ahalawe kwaviya adifumbimilatimila naho akiyegezela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu niyo ahitula kugamba, “Hitumigwa kwezingoto zagigile za want'hu wa Izilaeli aawo du.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Aaho yudya mvele niyo amfikila madi akamgamba, “Zumbe nambize.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Hivo vedi kuguha nk'hande ya awana na kwink'ha makuli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Yudya mvele niyo agamba, “Ni kindedi Zumbe, mna hata makuli nayo yalogotaga visiga vikutomoka mwe meza ya zumbe ywawe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yesu niyo amhitula kugamba, “Mnala, mhuwi wako ni mkulu, nevinde viya ukuunga.” Aaho yudya mwana kike niyo ahona.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya want'hu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu ahalawaga no kuita mnk'handa mwe diziwa dya Galilaya, akwela kwo mnima niyo ahumula. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mdugano mkulu wa mwiizilaga wakamwigaila want'hu waholomp'hale, want'hunt'hu, viwete, vimumu na want'hu wabindile ingi, niyo wawatambalika heviga vakwe niyo awahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Want'hu wehelagwa weze waone vimumu valonga, viwete vagenda, waholomp'hale wahona mant'hunt'hu nawo wasinya, niyo wamtogolesa Mnungu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awenk'ha nk'hande want'hu milongo mine</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu niyo awetanga wanamp'hina wakwe, niyo awagamba, “Naona mbazi nawo mdugano uno mkulu Kwaviya nekindanya mwa mazuwa amatatu yose, mna waswesa chokudya, name hikuzumila kuwalaga haheina kuwenk'ha chokudya, Kwaviya na wagwe mteho mwe sila wakauya kwe kaya.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamgamba, “Chapatahi nk'hande kikint'he mdugano uno wose?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu niyo auza, “Mnanayo mikate mingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wana mp'hina wakwe niyo wamhitula, “Mfungate na visamaki vigeke.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Ivo Yesu niyo awagamba want'hu wekale hasi ho ulwazo. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Niyo aguha idya migate mfungate na visamaki, niyo amtogola Mnungu, niyo abendula no kuwenk'ha wanamp'hina, wanamp'hina nao niyo wawapasila awant'hu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wose wadyaga, niyo weguta. Niyo wanamp'hina waduganya nt'hangulu mfungate zimemile vibesu ve visigale ve mikate.<verse eid="MAT 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Want'hu waidyaga wabulaga alufu kane, wagosi aawo du, haheina kuwawaza wana hamwenga na wavele.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Naho niyo Yesu awalaga want'hu, no kwingila mwe ngalawa niyo aita kwe isi ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Waunga vilagiso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Niyo Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wamwizila Yesu wakamwinika kwa kumgamba adamanye vilagiso kulawa kulanga vikuga vilagise kugamba kalawa kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Mna Yesu awahitulaga kugamba, “Zuwa dikaswa mwagamba kwaunga kunde kwedi, Kwaviya ulanga wink'hundu. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kukanda mtondo wedi mwagamba kwa unga kunde vula kulu Kwaviya ulanga wi nk'hundu naho utitihala. Mwadaha kumanya umsimo, mkausinya ulanga mna mdunduga kumanya vilagiso va amazuwa aya. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Cheleko kiihiye naho cha wahabwasi nicho cha awant'hu wa amazuwa aya! Mwaniunga niwenk'heni vilagiso? Bule! No mwink'higwe kilagiso kimwenga cha Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Niyo awaleka no kukeitila akeitila.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugwadu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Umwo wanamp'hina wandaga wakajink'hanya ng'ambu ye diziwa, wajalaga kuguha mkate wowose udya. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnde na wengele, naho mkedime no ugwadu ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Niyo wakonga kulosanya wenye kwa weye kugamba, “Kalonga ivi kwaviya hakiguhile mkate wowose.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Mna Yesu ayamanyaga ayo wandaga wakalonga. Niyo awauza, “Nyuwe mhungukilwe ni mhuwi! Nii mwatalaula mwe mbuli yokuswesa mikate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Mkei kukomboganya hata haluse? Mjala ivo nabendulaga mikate idya mishano niyo wadya want'hu milongo magana mashano? Mwamemezana nt'hangulu nyingahi? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Naho togoleni mikate mfungate wadyaga want'hu milongo magana mane? Mwamemeza nt'hangulu nyingahi? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Vivihi hamkukombaganya viya nehilonga imbuli ye mikate? Kedimeni no ugwadu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Aho wanamp'hina wakwe niho wakombaganyaga kugamba hawafundaga wakedime no ugwadu we mikate, ila wakedime na mahinizo ya mafalisayo hamwenga na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amkombaganya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27">Maliko 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu aitaga mwe isi ya Kaisalia Filipi, uko awauzaga wanamp'hina wakwe akawagamba, “Want'hu wagamba miye ni miye yuhi?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wamhitulaga kugamba, “Wamwenga wagamba ni weye Yohana Mbatizi, wamwenga wagamba Eliya, naho wamwenga wagamba Yelemia hegu u yumwenga mwa walotezi wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Niyo awauza, “Nyuwe mwagamba ni miye yuhi?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulo niyo ahitula, “Weye nuyo Kilisito, Mwana ywa Mnungu e mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu niyo amhitila, “Una kinyemi weye Simoni mwana Yohana. Kwaviya ikindedi iki hwink'higwe ni mnt'hu yeyose, mna kwinkwa ni Tate e kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Naivo nakugambila, weye Petulo u luwe, naho mo luwe ulu neni dizenge fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito, naho file yoyose heidahe kudihuma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nohwink'he vikomoelo vo Useuta wa kwe mbingu, na yadya ukuunga ulemeze mwe isi nekinde kilemezwa kulanga, na kiya ukuunga ukizumile mwe isi nekinde kizumilwa kulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Niyo Yesu awafingiza wanamp'hina wakwe wase kumgambila mnt'hu yeyose kugamba yehe niye Kilisito, Mkombozi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga imbuli ya masulumizo ne file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kukongela aho Yesu akongaga kuwagambila awanamp'hina wakwe haheina kufisa, kugamba aungwa aite Yelusalemu, na uko na apate masulumizo mengi kulawa kwa wakale na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na awahinizi we miko ya Musa enk'higwe Mnungu. Naho naakomigwe na mna zuwa dya katatu naauyuke.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petulo niyo amguha hank'handa, no kumtivila akamgamba, “Heidahike Zumbe mbuli enga iyo ikubwiile!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu niyo amhitukila no amgamba Petulo, “Halawe mwa meso yangu, weye Mwavu! Wanikindila kulongole mwe sila yangu, Kwaviya ufanyanyi uwo unanao hakulawa kwa Mnungu, uwo wa kimnt'humnt'hu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Niyo Yesu awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Uneva yeyose aunga kunitimila akelave kindedi, aketwike kiwambilo wakwe wa masulumizo, niyo anitimila.” <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Yeyose akuunga kuuhonya ugima wakwe naazaganye, mna akuwazaganya zumila wakwe kwa ajili ya miye na uone. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Uneva mnt'hu anenk'wa isi yose, mna awaza ugima wakwe, naakeongezelei? Hegu mnt'hu aunga ausakanye ugima wakwe na kint'hu chani? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwaviya Mwana Mnt'hu neeze mwo uwedi utendese wa Ise hamwenga na watumigwa wa kwe mbingu, niyo awaliha want'hu kwa kila yumwenga viligane na viya adamanye. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nawagambilani ikindedi kugamba weyaho mwa woho wakimale aha, hawadugane ne file heweenati kumuwona Mwana Mnt'hu akeza mo Useuta wakwe.<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Uhituko wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mtandatu Yesu awaguhaga. Petulo, Yakobo, hamwenga na Yohana nduguye dya Yakobo aawo du, niyo awalongoza mpaka kulanga mwo mnima. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ahadya wamuonaga akahituka ifuta yakwe, ifuta yakwe yangalaga enga zuwa, suke zakwe nao zandaga enga ung'azi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Aaho niyo walailwa ni Musa, hamwenga na Eliya, wakasimuila hamwenga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Petulo niyo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe viwagila suwe kunda aha, unaunga neni zenge viheha vitatu, kamwenga kako, kamwenga ka Musa, katuhu nako ka Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Umwo andile akagendela kulonga ivo, vunde ding'aile, niyo dyawagubika, izwi kulawa kulanga dyagambaga, “Uyu niye Mwanangu nimuungise, hyelelwa naye. Mtegelezeni yehe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Wanamp'hina weze weve diizwi, niyo wenamiza zinyuso zawe hasi kwa kogohesa. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Mna Yesu niyo eza kuwa dosa niyo awagamba, “Inukileni, msekogoha.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Niyo wenula meso, mna hawaone mnt'hu ila Yesu eke du.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Uno wandaga wakaseela kulawa kwo omnima, Yesu awafingizaga wase kugambila yoyose kwa yadya wayaone, mpaka mwana Mnt'hu eze auyuke.<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Wanamp'hina niyo wamuuza, “Vivihi wakuhiniza sigilizi? Wagamba Eliya naande kwiza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Ikindedi Eliya naande kwiza, naho naayadamanye yose. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Mna nawagambilani kugamba, Eliya keza kale, mna woho wadunduga kummanya, mna namdamanyila kale yose yadya waungile kumdamanyila, enga ivi Mwana Mnt'hu naye akusulumizwa mwe mikono yawe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Niyo wanamp'hina wakwe wakombaganya kugamba, naaka wasimulizila mbuli ya Yohana Mbatizi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mbwanga mta mpep'ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Aho weze wauye kwo mdugano, mnt'hu yumwenga amwizilaga akamfikila madi akamgamba, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Zumbe mfile mbazi mwanangu, ana kifutu naho alumiziswa, adulagwa momoto na mwamazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nawegailaga wanamp'hina wako mna wadunduga kumhonya.<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu niyo ahitula akagamba, “Nyuwe cheleko kiswesile mhuwi kikwaga! Nenikale na nyuwe mpaka ini? Nigaileni aha uyo ndugu ywetu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu aitivilaga idya mp'hepo, niyo yamlawa yudya mbwanga, aaho yudya mbwanga niyo ahona.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamwizila Yesu kinyele no kumuuza, “Zumbe, suwe nii kidunduga kuilava mp'hepo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kwaviya mswesa kunda na mhuwi ukint'hile. Nawagambilani ikindedi, mwandile no mhuwi ukuligana na kabeyu kwo mvumo, mwadaha kuugamba mnima uno, halawe aha uite hadya, naho niyo waita. Hakihali kikuunga kinde kidala kwa nyuwe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Mna naho, aya yadaha kulavigwa kwa kufunga na kulombeza Mnungu.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga kaidi ivo want'hu wakuunga wamkome</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Wana mp'hina wakwe weze weze wose Galilaya, Yesu awagambaga, “Mwana Mnt'hu naagelwe mwe mikono ya want'hu waihile. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Nawamkome, mna mwe dizuwa dya katatu naauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Wana mp'hina wakwe niyo waihiwa mwo ulosi uwo.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliho ye Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe weze wabule Kapelinaumu, watoza wa kodi wamwizilaga Petulo, niyo wamuuza kugamba, “Togola, Mhinizi ywenyu akulihaga kodi ye Nyumba ya Mnungu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petulo niyo amhitula kugamba, “Alihaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petulo eze engile kwe nyumba, Yesu niyo akonga kumuuza, “Simoni Petulo, wayafanyanya vihi? Mazumbe we isi waduganyaga maliho kulawa kwaani? Kulawa mwa wanawe wenye, hegu kulawa kwa wata kwiza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo niyo ahitula, “Kulawa kwa wata kwiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu niyo amgamba Petulo, “Nivedi. Uneva ni ivo wakaya hawakuliha. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Mna vileke kinase kukiguha hant'hu, ita kwe diziwa, kaduule induwano yako, guha samaki ya nk'hongo ukuunga unaigwile. Igubule mnomo wakwe, nouone shilingi mlongo na mbili, ziguhe, niyo unilihile kodi miye hamwenga na weye mwenye.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu mwa wose niani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ukati udya awanamp'hina wakwe wamwizilaga Yesu wakamuuza, “Niani umkulu mo Useuta wa kulanga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu etangaga kazana kadodo, niyo akakimalisa mgati mwawe, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />niyo agamba, “Nawagambilani kindedi, homdahe kwingila kwo Useuta wa kulanga uneva hamnahituke no kunda enga akazana aka kadodo. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Elo mnt'hu yeyose akuunga anakeseleze niyo anda enga aka kazana kadodo, uyo niye mkulu kujink'ha wose kwo Useuta wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Naho mnt'hu yeyose akuunga akatendele kise kazana enga aka kwa zina dyangu, mnt'hu uyo anitendela miye.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Mna mnt'hu yeyose akuunga analeke yumwenga mwa wadodo awa asekunihuwila miye atende wavu, viwagilwa uyo akakigwe iwe kulu dya kusagila, mwe singo yakwe, niyo adubwikwa mwo mnyongomela we bahali.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">1. want'hu waidi wakusigint'ha kwa maiwe ya kusigint'hila</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Hangi yenye isi kwaviya umwo mbuli zikuwatenda want'hu waze mhuwi wawe, mbuli enga izo hazikukindilika kulaila, mna hangi yemwenye mnt'hu akuunga aleke zilaile.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Uneva mkono hegu kiga chako vakutenda udamanye wavu, ukant'he niyo waudula hale, ni vedi kwa weye kwingila kwo ugima hwiina mkono, hegu kiga, kujink'ha kunda ne mikono yose miidi, hegu viga vose viidi niyo waduulwa kwo moto wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Naho sizo dyako dinakutenda unde Mwavu, ding'ole, niyo wadiduula. Ni vedi kwa weye kwingila kwo ugima na ziso dimwenga, kujink'ha kunda na meso yose maidi niyo wadulwa kwo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we ngoto yagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Msinyise mse kumbela yeyose mwa wadodo awa, kwaviya nawagambilani, watumigwa wawe uko kulanga we hameso ya Tate uko kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwaviya Mwana Mnt'hu keza kukombola kiya chagile.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mwafanyanya vihi, uneva mnt'hu mta magoto gana, niyo dimwenga mwa ayo dyaga naatende vivihi? Naayaleke yadya mlongo kanda na kanda mwo lugulu, no kugenda kudizungula diya digoto dimwenga dyagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Naho anadiona nawagambilani ikindedi, na ande na kinyemi kikulu kujink'ha yadya milongo kanda na kanda heyagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Enga iivo Tati yenyu ekulanga, hakuunga yumwenga mwa wadodo awa age.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuyo ana kutendela wavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Mnt'hu akuunga anakutendele wiihi, mwiitile niyo wakumlagisa uwavu wakwe. Mna utende ivo kwa kinyele, nyuweenye waidi du, anakwiva nivedi, kumpata umiao. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Mna hanakwivile kaguhe mnt'hu mtuhu yumwenga hegu waidi, vileke dia dikuunga dinalongwe mwakwe dimanyike kwa want'hu waidi hegu watatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Uneva anawalemela ao nao mwitangile kwe fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito, analemela kwe fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito kose, uyo umtende enga mnt'hu he mmanyize Mnungu hegu du uone enga mgwila kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufingiza na kuzumila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nawagambilani kindedi, dyodyose mkuunga mdivugale he isi nedinde divugalwa kwe mbingu, diya mkuunga mdikomole he isi nedinde dikomwolwa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Naho nawagambilani uneva waidi wenyu wanaivana mwe isi, kwa mbuli yoyose wakuunga wanalombeze neniidamanye kwe dizina dya Tate ekulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwaviya aho wakudugana waidi hegu watatu mwedizina dyangu, name nihamwenga nawo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Petulo niyo amwitila Zumbe, niyo amuuza, “Mnt'hu anitendele wavu kengahi name nimlekele? Anitendele malavo mfungate?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa mndima heena moyo wo kulekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu niyo amhitula kugamba, “Hiyo malavo mfugate du, mna malavo milongo mfugate malavo mfungate. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kwaviya Useuta wa kulanga ukeiga na mnt'hu yumwenga aungaga kumanya ivo wadamanye awatumwa wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Aho wakakonga kugambilana, egalagwa mnt'hu yumwanga andaga akadaiwa ni yudya zumbe zabulaga talant'ha milongo magana mlongo. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kwa mtumwa aswesaga cho kuliha, zumbe aungaga mtumwa atagigwe, yehe mwenye, mkaziwe awanawe, na vose viya wandaga navo vileke alihe dideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yudya mtumwa niyo amgweela akamfikila madi akagamba, nionele mbazi ludodo, nohulihe kila kint'hu! <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yudya zumbe ywo mtumwa niyo aona mbazi, niyo amuusila dideni dyakwe no amleka aite.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Mna umwo yudya mtumwa akaita kuse, niyo amuona mtumwa miyawe naakamdai dinali gana, niyo amgwila akamgamba, nilihe kila kiya hwink'hile! <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yudya mtumwa miyawe niyo amfikila madi, akamwiila mbazi, niyonele mbazi, nohulihe dideni dyako! <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Mna yehe niyo alemela, niyo amgwila no kumdula kwedivugailo, mpaka ande kuliha idideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Awatumwa watuhu weze wayaone yose yadya yalaile nawaona usungu, niyo waita kwa zumbe nokumgambila yose yalaile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Niyo zumbe amwitanga yudya mndima kwe nyumba nokumgamba, weye mndima ywiihile, nokunilombeza name niyo nakulekela yose yadya nehakutigiza, uguhile kwangu, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />We nawe hudahile kumwonela mbazi mndima miyao enga viya miye huonele mbazi? <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Kwa maya zumbe dyakwe naye niyo amhitukila nakumgela kwedivugailo alumizwe haheina kulekelwa, vikungwa alihe vose viya akudaiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Ivi nivo Tate ekulanga, akuunga amtende yeyose mwa nyuwe hakudaha kuwausila madeni wanduguze kwa mbazi kulawa momoyo wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahiniza mwe mbuli ye talaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu eze abinde kuyalonga ayo, ahalawaga Galilaya niyo aita mwe isi ya Uyahudi ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Fyo kulu dya want'hu dya mtimilaga niyo awahonya uko.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wamwiizilaga na ugeza kumgwila kwa kumuuza, “Togola haviihile kwa mnt'hu kumwasa mkaziwe kwa lema dyodyose?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu awahitulaga akawagamba, “Hamsomile mawandiko msunt'hilwa kugamba, aho nk'hongo Muumbi aumbaga mgosi na mvele? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Naho Mnungu agambaga, kwa aya mgosi na awase ise na nine, niyo anda na mkaziwe, naho awa waidi nawande hiyo waidi naho, ila nawande mwili umwenga. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Hawande waidi naho, woho wanda mwili umwenga. Kwa ivo walunganywe ni Mnungu, mnt'hu ase kuwa panga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Mafalisayo wamuuza Yesu, “Nii Musa akisigiilaga kugamba mnt'hu adaha kumwink'ha mkaziwe talaka niyo amwasa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Musa awalekagani muwase wavele wenyu kwaviya mna nk'hani. Mna havandaga enga ivo kukongela kwo kuumbigwa kwe isi. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Naivo wagambilani nyuwe, yeyose akuunga amwase mkaziwe hi kwa mbuli ya uhabwasi, niyo alomba mvele mtuhu, naande mhabwasi. Na akuunga alombe yudya mvele naye, atenda uhabwasi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamgamba Yesu, “Uneva nivo vili kwa mgosi na mkaziwe, ni vedi mnt'hu asekulomba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hiyo wose kuihokela imbuli ino ni kwa wadya du wasagulwe ni Mnungu kunda ivo. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwaviya ziuko mbuli heezikuligana zikuleka mnt'hu asekulomba. Wamwenga nivo welekwe, wamwenga watakutendigwa ni want'hu kunda ivo, wamwenga nao hawakulomba kwa kuuzugula Useuta wa Mnungu. Yeyose akuidaha imbuli ino naaihokele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awavikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Naho niyo egailwa wana wadodo awageleke mikono yakwe awavikile. Mna wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wawativila wadya wawegale. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Walekeni wana wadodo waniizile, msekuwafingiza, kwaviya Useuta wa kulanga ni wa want'hu enga awana awa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Agelekaga mikono yakwe mwa awo wana, niyo ahalawa.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga mta ugoli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mgoli amwizilaga Yesu akamgamba, “Mhinizi, naungwa nidamanye mbuli yani yedi vileke nihokele ugima wa ulo na ulo?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nii waniuza uwedi? Hahali mnt'hu ywedi, ywedi ni Mnungu ekedu. Mna uneva waunga wingile kwo ugima wa mazuwa hasila, damanya mwiko viya zikulonga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amuza Yesu, “Ni zihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu niyo amhitula, “Usekukoma, usekunda mgenda na wavele hi wako, usekubawa, usekumlongelezela mnt'hu mbuli hi za kindedi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />uweve iso na nyokwe, naho uwaunge weyao enga viya ukukeunga weye mwenye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo ahitula, “Yose ayo hiyatoza, hisigazai naho?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Ukaunga unde kukint'ha mo uwedi, katage viya unanavo niyo wawapangila wakiwa, ivo naunde na kindolo uko kulanga. Ukajika nitimile.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yudya mnt'hu eze eve ivo, ahalawaga aihiwe, Kwaviya andaga mgoli mkulu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Niyo Yesu alonga na wanamp'hina wakwe kugamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, ni vidala vitendese kwa mgoli kwingila kwo Useuta wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Navuzagiza ni vihufu ngamia komboka mwa kalanga ke singano, mna hi mgoli kwingila kwo Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Wanamp'hina wakwe weze weve ivo, naweeheleswa, niyo wauza, “Uneva ni ivo, niani naadahe kuhona?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu niyo awasinya kwa udahi no kuwagamba, “kwa want'hu hevidahike, mna kwa Mnungu yose ni mahufu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Petulo niyo amhitula, “kaula,” Suwe kileka kila kint'hu niyo chakutimila. “Nekink'higwei?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu niyo awahitula akawagamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, nyuwe, umwo Mwana Mnt'hu akekala mwe difumbi dyakwe dyo uwedi utendese, niho nyuwe nanywe mkunitimila nomwikale mwe viti mlongo na viidi mkayasengela makabila mlongo na maidi ya Waizilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Naho yeyose alekile nyumba yakwe, hegu wandugu wa kigosi na walumbuse na ise na nine, hegu wanawe ne zink'honde zakwe, kwa kunizungula miye naahokele malavo gana ya viya avilekile, naho neenk'higwe ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Mna wengi wa nk'hongo nawaziigile, wadya nao wazigiile nawande wa nk'hongo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Wandima mwe nk'honde ye mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Kwaviya Useuta wa kwe mbingu ukeiga enga ivi. Mnt'hu mta nk'honde yakwe, akelailaga kilo kilo akawapangile want'hu ndima mwe nk'honde yakwe ye mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Naho weze wazumilane kuwaliha maliho ya zuwa dimwenga, niyo awasindikiza kwe nk'honde ye mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ize inde saa nt'hatu, niyo afosa naho kuse yo mgunda ambwilaga watuhu wakimale hedigwilo, heweina chokudamanya, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />niyo awagamba, nanywe iteni kwe nk'honde yangu ye mizabibu mkadamanye ndima neniwaliheni viya muwagilwe kulihwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Niyo waita. Eze afose naho, ize ibule sa ya mtandatu na sa kanda, adamanyaga enga viya va bosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Afosaga naho ize ibule sa ya mlongo na imwenga aonaga watuhu wakimale hagihi, niyo awauza, nyuwe nii mkimala aha msi mgima mswesa ndima? <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Niyo wamhitula, kwaviya hahali akink'hile ndima, niyo awagamba, nivedi, nanywe iteni mkadamanye ndima kwe nk'honde yangu ye mizabibu.<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Kisingi kize kibule, zumbe wo mgunda niyo amgamba umnyamp'hala, wetange wandima wose uwalihe amaliho yawe, akakonga yudya azigiile, mpaka kwa uyu wa bosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Wadya want'hu wakongile indima sa mlongo na imwenga, nawalihigwa shilingi kila yumwenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ivo weze weze wadya wose wakongaga bosi, nawakamanya kugamba nawalihigwe na maholokela, mna woho nawo nawalihigwa maliho ya zuwa dimwenga kila yumwenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nawasinya yadya maliho niyo wakonga kumkalaliza mta mgunda, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />wakamgamba, Awa wazigiile wadamanya ndima sa dimwenga du, suwe kiikigwa mwe dizuwa msi mgima, mna wawaliha vikuligana na suwe! ”<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Mta mgunda niyo amhitula yumwenga ywawe akamgamba, “mbuyangu, hikuhujile. Hamwenga na ayo kiivana mlihwe maliho ya zuwa dimwenga kwa wose. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Elo guha matundu yako ukeitile. Naunga nimlihe yudya azigiile enga viya hulihile weye. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Hiwagilwe kuyadamanyila ndima matundu yangu enga ivo huunga? Hegu kwingila finju kwaviya miye ni ywedi? ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu niyo akomeleza kugamba, “Akuziigila ivi haluse, naande ywa nk'hongo, ywa nk'hongo naye naazigile.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimuila katatu mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Umwo Yesu andaga akaita Yelusalemu, awaguhaga wanamp'hina wakwe kwe nyumba, niyo alonga nao haheina want'hu akawagamba. <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Kauleni,” “chaita Yelusalemu, na Mwana Mnt'hu naagelwe mwe mikono ya wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wahinizi wa Miko, naho nawamsengele kukomwa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />naho na wamvuze kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi, nawamzesezigile na kumtoa mikotya niyo wamuwamba mwo kiwambilo, mna mwe dizuwa dya katatu kukongela dizuwa dye file yakwe, naande kauyuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maombi ya mvele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Niyo mkaza Zebedayo hamwenga na wanawe waidi wambasa Yesu niyo wamfikila madi akalombeza kint'hu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Waungani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Yudya mvele niyo agamba, “Sigiila kugamba wanangu awa, yumwenga ekale kulume kwako, na yumwenga naye kumoso uko kwo Useuta wako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Hamkimanyize kia mkulombeza. Ivi mwadaha kukinyweela kiamp'ha changu cha masulumizo kia hunyweela miye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Niyo wamhitula, “Chadaha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Yadahika mkadaha kukinyweela ikikombe changu, mna ukwikala kulume hegu kumoso, miye hina ulamuzi. Kulume na kumoso kuikilwa wadya waikilwe lumwe ni Tate.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Naho wadya mlongo weze weve zimbuli za wadya wandugu niyo waihiwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Mna Yesu niyo awetanga akawagamba, “Mmanya kugamba wakulu wa want'hu hi Wayahudi wawalongoza want'hu kikwank'walu, wakulu wawe nawo wawombosela udahi wawe mwawo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Mna hevinde ivo kwenyu. Akuunga kunda mkulu umwenyu, vamuunga ande mtumwa ywenyu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />naho mnt'hu akuunga ande ywa nk'hongo, akonge kunda mtumwa ywenyu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />kwaviya Mwana Mnt'hu hezile adamanyilwe ndima ni want'hu mna keza kuwadamanyila ndima want'hu, no kuulava ugima wakwe vileke want'hu wengi wakombolwe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya Mant'hunt'hu Waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Umwo Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe wakalawa Yeliko, fyo kulu dya want'hu dyamtimilaga. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Want'hu waidi mant'hunt'hu wekalaga hank'handa he sila. Naho weze weve Yesu omboka, niyo wabongeela wakagamba, “Zumbe Mwana Daudi kionele mbazi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Want'hu niyo wawativila no kuwagamba wanyamale, mna woho niyo wagendeela kukweza izwi, “Zumbe Mwana Daudi kionele mbazi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu niyo akimala no kuwetanga, niyo awauza, “Mwaunga niwadamanyileni mbwai?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Niyo wamhitula, “Zumbe chaunga kidahe kuwona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu niyo awaonela mbazi, niyo awadosa meso yawe, aaho niyo wadaha kuwona, no kumtimila.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa kinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Aho Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe weze wabule hagihi na Yelusalemu no mpaka Betifage mo Mnima we Mizeituni, aho Yesu nakawatuma wanamp'hina wakwe waidi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akawagamba, “Iteni he kaya iyo ihalongole, nomkabwiile mp'hunda ikakigwe hamwenga na mwanawe. Zidoholeni mnigaile. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Mnt'hu yeyose akuunga awauzeni dyodyose, mgambileni kugamba, Zumbe aziunga, naho naazivuze.” Nae naawa zumileni.<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Idi dilaile vileke yadya alongaga mlotezi yakint'he.<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ugambileni mzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">kaula Zumbe ywako akwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">mjalamu wa moyo, emwe mp'hunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">na mwana mp'hunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Wanamp'hina waitaga, niyo wadamanya enga viya Yesu Awasigilaga. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wamwigaila mp'hunda no mwana mp'hunda, watandikaga zisuke zawe mnanga niyo Yesu ekala mnanga mwe mp'hunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mafyo ya want'hu wabindile ingi watandikaga zisuke zawe mwe sila, wamwenga nawo nawasenga mahuto no kuyatandika mwe sila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Idifyo dya want'hu diya dimlongoele na diya dikumtimila, wandaga wakanga kwa izwi kulu wakagamba, “Ntogola kwa Mwana Daudi! Mnungu naamvikile yudya akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe. Naatogolwe Mnungu uko kulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu eze engile Yelusalemu, mzi wose no wituka, wakauza, “Uyu ni ani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Diya idifyo niyo dyawahitula, “Uyu ni Yesu, Mlotezi kulawa Nazaleti ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu engilaga mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, niyo awakump'husa kuse wadya wose wandaga wakataga no kugula mdya mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. Azikindulaga zimeza za wadya nawaka sakanya matundu, ne viti va wataga suwa, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />akawagamba, “Iwandikwa mwe mawandiko kugamba, nyumba yangu neitangwe nyumba ya kuvika Mnungu. Mna nyuwe mwaitenda mp'hanga ya wabavi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Want'hu viwete na mant'hunt'hu wamwizilaga kudya kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu niyo awahonya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Mna wakulu wa Walava nt'hambiko na wahinizi we zi sigilizi, waihiwagwa weze waone yadya ya kweheela akudamanya Yesu, no ukwanga kwa wana wadodo mwe Nyumba idya ya Mnungu wakagamba, “Naatogolwe Mwana Daudi!” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Niyo wamgamba, “Weva ivo wana awa wakulonga?” Yesu niyo awagamba, “Heiye, neva.” “Hamsomile mwa Mawandiko? mwahiniza wana ne vizana, kulava nt'hogola zikinth'ile.”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Niyo Yesu awalekaga no kuita kuse yo umzi, aitaga Besania, uko agonaga.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Auligita Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Mtootondo Umwo andaga akeza naho kwo mzi, akeivaga sala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Eze auone mtini hagihi ne sila, aubasaga, mna haonaga matunda ila na mani du, niyo augamba, “Howize weleke matunda naho ulo na ulo.” Aaho umti udya niyo wanyuluka.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Wanamp'hina wadya weze wayaone yadya niyo weehelwa wakagamba, “Kwa vivihi mti udya ukanyuluka ludole?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, mnanda namhuwi, naho msekung'asang'asa, nomdahe kudamanya hiyo enga idi du dyo didamanyike dyo mtini, nomdahe hata kuugamba mnima uno, ita kakedule kwe bahali, naho niyo vanda. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nawagambilani ikindedi mnanda na mhuwila nom mhokele kia ukulombeza.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu eze engile mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, Umwo andaga akahiniza, wakulu wa Walava nt'hambiko ne wadala a vilongozi va want'hu wambasaga wakamuuza. “Wayadamanya aya kwa udahi waani? Naho niani akwink'hile udahi uwo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Neniwauzeni nanywe mbuli imwenga, mna nihitula name neniwa gambileni, kugamba nadamanya aya kwa udahi waani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Nigambileni, Ubatizi wa Yohana walawaga nahi? Walawaga kwa Mnungu, hegu walawaga kwa want'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Watalaulaga woho kwa woho kugamba, “Nekigeeze? Uneva kinagamba, ulawa kwa Mnungu, naakiuze kugamba, nii hamumhuwile mhuwile Yohana? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Mna naho kinagamba, ulawa kwa want'hu, chogoha want'hu Kwaviya wose nawamanya kugamba Yohana andaga mlotezi ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ivo niyo wamhitula kugamba, “Hakimanyize” Naye Yesu niyo awagamba, “Name heniwagambileni kugamba nayadamanya aya kwa udahi waani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa awana waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Mwafanyanya vihi mwe mbuli ino? Kwandaga na mnt'hu andaga na wanawe waidi wa kilume, niyo ambasa wa nk'hongo na kumgamba, mwanangu, uite ukadamanye ndima kwe nk'honde ye mizabibu dielo. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yudya mwana niyo ahitula kugamba, hikuunga, mna akajika niyo afanyanya vint'hu niyo aita. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Niyo Tati ya mnt'hu ambasa yudya mtuhu niyo amlonga enga iviya alongile kwa ywa nk'hongo. Yudya mwana niyo agamba, tate neniite, mna niyo haitile. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Mwa waidi awa, niani adamanye yadya aungile tati yawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Niyo wahitula, “Ni yudya ywa kaidi.” Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, wagwila kodi na mapamp'he nawawalongoeleni kwo Useuta wa Mnungu, <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />kwaviya Yohana awezilagani niyo awalagisani zisila ze kindedi mna hamwamtegelezaga, mna wagwila kodi na mapamp'he nawamwiva niyo wamhuwila. Mna nyuwe hamwenga no ukuyaona aya hamuungile kweiila no kumhuwila.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo waikizilwa mwe nk'honde ye mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Tegelezeni mliganyizo mtuhu.” “Kwandaga na mnt'hu mta nk'honde yakwe, ahandaga mizabibu, niyo aizengela gomela, niyo asimba bome dyo kuhondela no kuzenga hant'hu henuke hakumvikila Mnungu cho wamizi, niyo awiikiza kwa walimi wamwenga, niyo yehe atamba. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Msimo wo kuvuna uze ubuze, atumaga wandima wakwe kwa wadya waikizilwe, wakamguhile amaliho yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Wadya walimi niyo wawagwila wandima wadya yumwenga wamtoa, yumwenga wamkoma, yudya ywa katatu niyo wamtowa na maiwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Mna niyo egala wandima watuhu kwao, wasumpule uwingi kujink'ha wadya wa bosi. Mna naho wadya walimi niyo wawatendela viihile enga wadya wa nk'hongo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kwo mzigilizo amwigalaga mwanawe mwenye kwawo akagamba, mafani wadaha kumwogoha. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Mna wadya walimi weze wamuwone umwana, niyo wagambilina kugamba, mkipe keza, nekimkomeni kiguhe ikipe chakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ivo niyo wamgwila no kumduula kuse ye nk'honde ye mizabibu, niyo wamkoma.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu niyo wauza, “Haluse zumbe wo mgunda we mizabibu akeza naawatende vivihi walimi ao?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Niyo wahitula, “Naawakome nao wadya wahi, niyo umgunda wakwe we mizabibu nawaikizile walimi watuhu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu niyo awauza, Togoleni hamnati msome ivo viwandikwe mwa mawandiko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Iwe diya wazesi wadilemele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">dinda iwe dikuungiswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Zumbe niye adamanye ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">naho ni mbuli ya kwehela mwa meso yetu.<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yesu niyo agendeela kulonga, “Naivo nawagambilani,” “nomhokigwe Useuta wa Mnungu niyo wenk'hwa want'hu wakudamanya ayedi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Akuunga agwe mwe diiwe idyo naavunike vunike, uyo nedimgwele nedimtigint'he ande luvumbi.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo weze weve miliganyizo ya Yesu, niyo wabunk'hula kugamba nakawalonga woho, <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />wazungulaga ubala wakumgwila, mna wandaga wakogoha umdugano, Kwaviya want'hu wamanyaga kugamba Yesu ni mlotezi ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we ndoza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu nakawenk'ha mliganyizo mtuhu akawagamba, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Useuta wa kulanga wakeiga ivi. Kwandaga na zumbe yumwenga amfunganyilaga mwanawe kilume wila wa ndoza. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Atumaga wandima kwa wose wadya walalikagwa kwe ndoza wakawetange, mna wadya walalikwe walemelaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Niyo naho atuma wandima watuhu no kuwagamba, Wagambileni wose wadya walalikwe kugamba, hikeika lumwe fugo yangu, naho hifunganya kila kigimbale na nk'hande zangu, hifunganya kila kint'hu. Soni kwe fugo! <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Mna wadya walalikwe hawaone kugamba ni kint'hu, niyo wakeagala, yumwenga kwe nk'honde, yumwenga naye kwo uchuuzi wakwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />wamwenga niyo wawagwila wadya wandima watumigwe, niyo wawatenda vihile no kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yudya zumbe ahigagwa, niyo egala wank'hondo wakwe, niyo wakuwakoma wakomi wadya no kuutimp'ha moto umzi wawe. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, fugo ye ndoza ibula, mna wadya walalikwe hawaungile ukwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Iteni kwezi sila mp'handa, walalikeni wose mkuunga muwabwiile, weze kwe ndoza. <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Wandima wadya niyo waita kwe zisila zink'hulu, niyo wawaduganya want'hu wose wawaone, awavu na awedi, ndoza niyo yamema want'hu.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Mna zumbe eze engile, kuwakaula wageni, niyo kwanda na yumwenga hevaile suke yo kuitila kwe ndoza? Mna uyo mnt'hu hahitule dyodyose. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Niyo amuuza, mbuyangu kwingila vivihi aha hwiina suke ya kuvaligwa mwe ndoza? <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Yudya zumbe niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, ‘Mkakeni viga ne mikono mkamduule kuse kwo lwiza. Uko nokunde na ndilo no kugwegwejula meno.’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu niyo abindiliza akagamba, “Kwaviya wetangwe wabinda ingi, mna wasagulwe wageke.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi kwa kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Mafalisayo waitaga kuse wakaika mizungu na kumtegela Yesu vileke wamgwile mwe milosi yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Niyo wawatuma wanamp'hina wawe na hamwenga na kafyo kakwe Mahelode kwa Yesu, niyo wamgamba, “Mhinizi,” “kimanya kugamba weye u mnt'hu ywedi, naho wahiniza mbuli ya Mnungu mwe ikindedi, naho hukogoha ukulu wo mnt'hu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Elo ukigambile weye, waona vihi, ni vedi kumliha kodi uyu Seuta ywe Kilumi hegu vihi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Mna Yesu niyo abunk'hulaga fanyanyi zawe ziihile niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe watondwe! Nii mwanigeza? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Nilagiseni ihela ikulihila ikodi”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Niyo wamwink'ha, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Niyo awauza, “Ifuta imwe ihela yaani? Zina idi dyaani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Niyo wamhitula kugamba, “Va Seuta ywa Kilumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Niyo awagamba, “Mwink'heni Seuta ywa Kilumi viya vimuwagile, viya viwagile Mnungu navo mwink'heni Mnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Weze weve uhituzi wakwe, weheelagwa, niyo wahalawa.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli yo kuuyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Dizuwa idia Masadukayo wadya wakugamba hokunde no kuuyuka, wezaga kwa Yesu niyo wamuuza. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Wakagamba, “Mhinizi, Musa agambaga, uneva mnt'hu anabanika heina mwana kwa mkaziwe, nduguye amlombe mvele uyo vileke amwelekele wana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Haluse wandaga uko wandugu mfungate wekalaga aha, ywa nk'hongo alombaga, mna niyo abanika, mna kwaviya helekaga, mkaziwe aguhagwa ni nduguye. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Vandaga kwa ywa kaidi na wakatatu, viita ivo vibuile mwa ywa mfungate. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ko mzigilizo, yudya mvele naye niyo abanika. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Haluse kigambe mwe dizuwa dyo kuuyuka, mvele yudya naande ywaani, Kwaviya nakalombigwa ni wagosi mfungate?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Mna malema, kwaviya hamuyamanyize mawandiko yakukile, no udahi wa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwaviya, umwo want'hu wabanike wakauyuka, hokunde na kulomba hegu kulombigwa, kwaviya want'hu nawande enga watumigwa wa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Mna imbuli yo kuuyuka, hamsomile ivo Mnungu awagambileni, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Miye ni Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu, Mnungu ywa Isaka, Mnungu ywa Yakobo.’ Ni Mnungu ywa wagima, hiye Mnungu ywa wabanike.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Idifyo dya awant'hu dize dive viya, niyo dyeehelwa ukuhiniza kwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ink'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo weze weve kugamba Masadukayo waswesa dyo kumuuza Yesu, Mafalisayo niyo wekala hamwenga, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />yumwenga mwa woho mhinizi we sigilizi, niyo amuuza Yesu akamgeza, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mhinizi,” “Mwiko mkulu ni uhi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “ ‘Umuunge Zumbe Mnungu ywako kwo moyo wako wose, no kwo unt'hu wako wose, no kwo ubala wako wose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ino niyo umwiko mkulu nayo niyo ya nk'hongo. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Nayo iyuko miko kaidi, ikugamba, ‘Umuunge miyao enga viya ukukeunga we mwenye.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Zisigilizi izi zimbuli ziduganya miko yose na mahinizo ya walotezi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Aho Mafalisayo weze wadugane, Yesu niyo awauza, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mwaona vihi mwe mbuli ya Kilisito? Ni mwana ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Niyo wamgamba, “Mwana Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Niyo naho awauza, “Vinda vivihi elo mwa Muye ywa Mnungu, Daudi akamwitanga ‘Zumbe?’ Kwaviya agambaga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Zumbe nakamgamba Zumbe ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">wikale kulume kwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mpaka aho neniwaike wank'hondo wako hasi ye iviga vako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Elo haluse Daudi akamwitanga ‘Zumbe’ vanda vivihi naho Kilisito Mkombozi ande Mwanawe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Hahandile na yeyose, ahitulaga mbuli hegu mnt'hu yeyose kugeza kumuza mbuli yoyose kukongela zuwa diya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanya mwe mbuli ya wahinizi we zimwikona Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Niho Yesu alongaga na want'hu na wanamp'hina, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Awagamba, “Wahinyi we Zimiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo wana udahi wa kuhiniza mahinizo ya Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ivo elo vaunga muyatoze no kuyadamanya yose yadya wakuwagambilani, mna mse kutimila mwa yadya wakudamanya, Kwaviya hawakudamanya enga viya wakubilikiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Woho wakaka madondolo makulu niyo wayahasikiza mwa maega ya want'hu, mna woho wenye hawakuunga hata kuikwafa ne nividole vawe kuwambiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Yose wakuyadamanya waungisa watogolwe ni want'hu, wagalamula mapingu yawe no kugenyeza mwezisuke zawe zint'hali. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Waungisa kwikala mwo fumbi wa kulongole, mwe midugano yo ludyo, na mwe zinyumba za kulombezela Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Mwaungisisa kulamswa mwa magwilo no kwitangwa Mhinizi. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Mna nyuwe msekwitangwa ‘Mhinizi,’ Kwaviya Mhinizi ywenyu ni yumwenga nanywe mwi wandugu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Naho msekumwitanga yoyose aha he isi ‘Tate’ Kwaviya Tati yenyu ni yumwenga ekulanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Naho msekwitangwa vilongozi, Kwaviya akuwalongoelani nyuwe ni yumwenga akwitangwa Kilisito Mkombozi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Umkulu umwenyu aungwa ande mndima ywenyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Kwaviya yeyose akukekweza, nakulumulwe, yudya nae akuke kulumula, naakwezigwe ni Mnungu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auligita utondwe wawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi we miko na Mafalisayo! Watondwe nyuwe! Mkuwavugaila want'hu Useuta wa kwe mbingu, mna nyuwe enye hamkwingila, hamkuwenk'ha sila wakuunga kwingila.<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi we zi miko na Mafalisayo! Mkudya nyumba za wadya wabanikilwe ni walume zawe, naho kwa utondwe, mwaketenda kulonga mabuli mengi na mengi mo kumvika Mnungu! Kwaivo nomsulumizwe masulumizo makulu.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye nyuwe wahinizi we Miko na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe watondwe! Mkuzunguluka mwe isi na mwe ibahali no kumtenda mnt'hu yumwenga kunda enga ivo nyuwe mkuhuwila, naho mkajika mwamtenda kunda mwana wa mo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo kuwajink'ha nyuwe wenye ivo mwili!<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye vilongozi mant'hunt'hu! Mwahiniziza kugamba, ‘Uneva mnt'hu anakwelisila mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, hicho kint'hu, mna mnt'hu anakwelisila kwe izahabu ye Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, naande kakegwila mwenye.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mant'hunt'hu wahezi nyuwe! Ni ihi ink'hulu, izahabu hegu Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu ikugela kilingo kinde kikukizwe? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Iviya iviya, mwagamba, ‘Uneva mnt'hu akwelisila hekilingo cha kulavila nt'hambiko hi kint'hu, mna akwelisila kint'hu kilavigwe mnanga mwe kilingo cho kulavila nt'hambiko naande kakegwila mwenye.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Nyuwe want'hu mant'hunt'hu! Ni ihi ink'hulu, ni malavo hegu kilingo cha kumvikila Mnungu kikukukiza malavo? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ivo elo akwelisila hekilingo hakumvikila Mnungu cha Mnungu, akelisa mwe icho na malavo yose yemwe hant'hu henuke hakumvikila Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Naho akwelisila Nyumba ya Mnungu, akelisa kwe iyo hamwenga na Mnungu wenye akwikala uumo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Naho akukelisila kulanga, akelisa ukalo wa Mnungu no umwenye akwikala uumo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi we Miko na Mafalisayo! Watondwe! Mwalava zaka ze zimboga za mani na bizali, ne jila, mna mleka kutimila zimbuli zink'hulu zisiigilwe, zo utondowazi na mbazi no uhuwilwa. Zimbuli izi zink'hulu mwaungwa mzi damanye, haheina kuyajala ayo matuhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Vilongozi mant'hunt'hu! Mwatuja mbu mna mwamela mp'hunda!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi we Miko na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe watondwe! Mwasunt'ha viyamp'ha ne vihungu kwa kuse, mna kundani kumema yadya myalavile kwo kuwahoka want'hu no ugila. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Nyuwe Mafalisayo mant'hunt'hu! Indeni kusunt'ha kundani ye viyamp'ha ne vihungu, niho kuse nako kunde kusunt'hika!<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi we zimiko na Mafalisayo! Mkeiga vikuta vikakigwe, ukavikaula kwa kuse kunda viwakigwa, mna kwa kundani vimema want'hu wabanike, mavuha na nt'hagant'ha zose. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Enga ivo kwa kuse mwa kaulwa kunda want'hu wedi, mna kwa kundani mmema utondwe no wavu.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awatambuila masulumizo yawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye wahinizi vilongozi we miko na mafalisayo watondwe! Mwazenga vikuta va walotezi wa Mnungu no kutuluma vikuta va wawagile Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Naho mwagamba vandile chandaga uuko, aho watati zetu, hegu hamwandile hamwenga mwo kuwakoma walotezi wa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ivo elo mwalonga uwona nyuwe wenye kugamba ni nyuwe mwelekwe kwa wadya wose wawakomaga walotezi wa Mnungu! <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Gendeeleni elo, vileke mkomeleze kiya wakongaga watati zenyu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mazoka nyuwe naho cheleko cha mazoka! Msekugamba nomkehonye no usengelo wo kugeligwa kwo moto houkuzima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Haluse nawegailani naho walotezi wa Mnungu, want'hu wano umanyi wa Mnungu, na wahiniza Miko. Naho wawenga nomuwakome, wamwenga nao nomuwagele mwe viwambilo, wamwenga nomuwabunt'he mwe nyumba zenyu zo kuvikila, wamwenga nomuwaguluse kulawa mzi umwenga kuita mzi mtuhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Naho niyo isakame ya wose wawagilwe ni Mnungu idya itike, neinde umwenyu, kukongela ya Habili mpaka ya Zakalia mwana Balaki, Zakalia mwamkomaga hagati ye Nyumba ya Mnungu na hekilingo hokumvikila Mnungu malavo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nawagambilani kindedi, maliho yo ukomi uno wose nayande mwa want'hu wa mazuwa aya.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awaiila want'hu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Ho! Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu! Weye ukuwakoma walotezi wa Mnungu na kuwatoa maiwe wadya watumigwe kwako ni Mnungu! Kengahi niungile kuwaduganya hamwenga awanao, enga viya nguku ikuwaduganya wakinda wakwe mwa amawawa yakwe mna haviungile! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Kaula elo nyumba yako neilekigwe hame. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nakugambilani, kukongela ivi haluse na kugendeela, hounione miye naho mpaka hadya nomgambe, ‘Kavikilwa yehe akwiza kwe dizina dya Zumbe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga kumoligwa kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Umwo Yesu andaga akahalawa he Nyumba ya Mnungu, wanamp'hina wakwe wamwitangaga vileke akaule mzengo we Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Niyo awagamba, “Kindedi aya yose myakaule vedi. Nawagambilani kindedi, hedisigale iwe mnanga mwo miyawe, yose nayamogoelwe hasi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makunt'ho na masulumizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Umwo Yesu andaga kahumula kwo lugulu lwe Mizeituni, wanamp'hina wakwe wamwiizilaga kinyele wakamgamba, “Kigambile, aya ulongile nayalaile ini naho ni kilagiso chani kugamba weye weza, nokubindilikila kwe isi?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Msinyise, yeyose ase kuwadant'hiliza. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwaviya naweze wabindile ingi kwa zina dyangu, wakagamba kila yumwenga niye Kilisito! Naho nawawadant'hilize want'hu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Nomwive nk'hondo na nt'hegelezi za nk'hondo. Mkaulise, msekwituka kwaviya ayo hayaleke kulaila, mna hokunde nuko kubindilikila kwe isi. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Isi na isi nezitoane, useuta nao kutoana na uzumbe mtuhu, nokunde na magumbo, na visingisa kila hant'hu. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Yose aya nayande enga nk'hongelo ya kulumwa usungu wa mvele kwingila nyumba.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Nanywe nawawagwileni no kuwasezenga mtendelwe yaihile, na kuwakoma, naho want'hu we isi zose nawawa ihieni, kwaviya mwanitimila miye. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Aho naho want'hu wengi nawahituke, naho nawa sezengane, naho nawaihiyane. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Naho walotezi wengi wo udant'hi na walaile nokudant'hiliza want'hu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Naho Kwaviya wavu nougenyele, lukunde kunde lwa want'hu no luhole. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Mna yudya mnt'hu akuunga afinyilize niyo abinda int'hambo niye akuunga ayokolwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Naho Mbuli Yedi ya useuta wa Mnungu neibilikizwe enga ulonga uwona kwa isi zose niho kubindilikila kwe isi nokwize.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubanangi we Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Aho mkeza kuwona Ihizo dikimala hakukile ha Mnungu, idyo alongaga mlotezi Danieli.” Wakusoma wakombaganye. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />“Niho wose we mwe isi ya Yuda, wanyilikile kwe vigulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Mnt'hu ekwe digulu dye nyumba yakwe asekuseela aguhe vint'hu vimwe nyumba. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Naho mnt'hu ekwe nk'honde, asekuuya na nyuma kuguha suke yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Makunt'ho makulu ni kwa wadya awabovu na wadya wakonk'heza mwa mazuwa ayo. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Lombezeni Mnungu kugamba nguluko zenyu zisekunda mwe dizuwa dya mp'heho, naho disekunda mwe dizuwa dya kuhumula. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwaviya nokunde na makunt'ho makulu heyenati kulaila kukongela kwo kuumbwa isi, mpaka ivi haluse, naho heyeze yalaile vituhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Naho vandile Mnungu hahungule mazuwa ayo, hegu hakwahonile mnt'hu yeyose, mna kwaviya weyuko wasagulwe, Mnungu naayahungule mazuwa ayo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Naho aho mnt'hu akakugamba, ‘Kaula, Kilisito eyuku!’ Hegu wakagamba, ‘Ehadya!’ Msekuhuwila. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwaviya nawalaile wakina Kilisito wo udant'hi na walotezi wa udant'hi, naho nawadamanye vihungi vikulu na mbuli za kwehela, vileke wawazaganye want'hu, vika dahika ni hamwenga na wadya wasagulwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Elo msinyise! Hiwagambilani kale yakwiza kulongole.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Hegu, yeyose akuwagambani, ‘Kauleni ekwe nyika!’ Msekuita, hegu du akuwagambani, ‘Kauleni e yuku kwe nyumba!’ Mse kumhuwila. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Saviya lumwemwe lukudaha kulaila ulailo wa zuwa, niyo lwaonwa usweelo wa zuwa, nivo vikuunga vinde ukwiza kwa Mwana Mnt'hu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Kwaviya hohose hakuunga hande ne kimba, ndege nyika naho nezidugane.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiziile ya Mwana Mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Aaho mazuwa ya makunt'ho yakeza kwomboka, zuwa nedigelwe lwiza naho umnenge nao houng'ale, nt'hondo nazo nezigwe kulawa kulanga, naho udahi wa kwe mbingu nousingisike. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Niho nokuonekele vilagiso va Mwana Mnt'hu akalaila mo ulanga, naho want'hu wose weisi nawahongeze no kuila aho wakeza kumuwona Mwana Mnt'hu akeza mwa mavunde ya kwe mbingu na udahi no uwedi utendese. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Naawatume watumigwa wakwe hamwenga na izwi kulu dye digunda, naho naawaduganye wasagulwa wakwe kulawa nt'hendelo izine ze isi, kukongela uheelo umwenga we isi, kuhinga uheelo mtuhu.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chokuhina kulawa mwo mti ukwitangwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Elo kwe diziti dikwitagwa mtini, kehinizeni mliganyizo uno. Aho mkaona amatambi yakwe yadakila no kulava mani mahya, manyeni kugamba uvuni uhagihi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Enga iivo, mneza kuyaona aya yose, manyeni kugamba Mwana Mnt'hu ehagihi kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, cheleko iki hekidahe komboka, mpaka vint'hu ivi vose vilaile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Ulanga ne isi nevomboke, mna milosi yangu heyomboke.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hahali amanyize dizuwa hegu sa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Hahali mnt'hu yoyose amanyize zuwa hegu sa, hi mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu, hegu Mwana mwenye. Haheina yeyose, Tate ekedu niye amanyize. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Enga viya vandaga mwe dizuwa dya Nuhu, nivo nevinde ukwiza kwa Mwana Mt'hu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwaviya mwa mazuwa yalongoele ugubiko wa mazi, want'hu wandaga wakanywa no kudya, kulombigwa no kulomba, mpaka mwe dizuwa diya Nuhu engile mwe ngalawa, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />naho hawamanyaga kint'hu chochose chadahaga kulaila, mpaka hadya wezile kukebwiila wose wagubikwa pele na mazi. Ivi nivo vikuunga vinde imiziile ya Mwana Mnt'hu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Want'hu waidi nawande henk'honde, yumwenga na aguhigwe yumwenga naasigwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Wavele waidi nawande wakasigint'ha, yumwenga na aguhigwe yumwenga naasigwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Ivo mnde meso kwaviya hammanyize aho neezile Zumbe ywenyu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Mna mmanye kugamba, yandile mta nyumba amanyize kilo kihi mbavi neezile, hegu nakekala meso no kuyamila inyumba yakwe isekumoligwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Naivo elo, weye nawe wikale meso, Kwaviya Mwana Mnt'hu naakwizile hadya hwi kawiile.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandima wahuwilwa na hi mhuwilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Niani elo mtumwa ywedi mhuwilwa akuzumilwa ni Zumbe ywakwe, vikutenda aikwe kunda mkulu mwa wandima watuhu, naho awenk'he nk'hande wandima weyawe kwa hadya hakuungwa?” <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Nevinde vedi kwo mtumwa enga uyo akuunga abwiilwe ni Zumbe dyakwe akadamanya ivo Umwo akauya. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, naa muike kunda mkulu wo ugoli wakwe wose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Mna mtumwa yudya aihile, alonga momoyo wakwe mwenye kugamba, Zumbe hakusunguza kwiza, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />naho niyo akonga kuwatoa wandima weyawe na kudya no kunywa hamwenga na wakozi. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Niho Zumbe ywakwe umtumwa uyo naauye zuwa dimwenga hewe kawiile wandima awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Naamsulumizise na kumwiika hamwenga na watondwe. Nuko nokunde ndilo no kugwegwejula ameno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa awali mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Naho, Useuta wa kulanga nounde enga ivi. Wali mlongo waguhaga vimuli vawe niyo wagenda kumhokela mlombi. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Washano mwa ao wandaga wahezi, washano watuhu wandaga wabala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Wadya wahezi waguhaga vimuli vawe, mna hawaguhile hamwenga na mavuta ya kongezela. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Mna wadya wabala vandaga wakeikila mavuta mnenge shupa zawe yo kugela mwe vimuli vawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mlombi uyo hasunguzaga kwiza, vilekile wose wakupile niyo wagona nt'hongo.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Mna ize ibuze kilo cha gati want'hu niyo wakonga kwanga, ‘Mlombi keza! Mwinuke mumhokele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Wadya wali niyo wenuka woseni no kuvidamanya vimuli vawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Wadya wahezi niyo wawagamba wadya wabala, ‘Kink'hageni mavuta ludodo, vimuli vetu vazima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Wadya wabala niyo vawagamba, ‘Bule! Haya kikint'he choseni nyuwe na suwe. Iteni kwe duka mkakeguile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Mna Umwo wandaga wakaita kokugula mavuta, mlombi niyo engila, wadya wali wakeikilaga lumwe niyo wengilanya no mlombi kwe ndoza, ulwivi niyo lwavugalwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Halongole, wadya watuhu nawo niyo weza wakagamba, ‘Zumbe! Zumbe! Kikomoele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Zumbe niyo awahitula, ‘Nawagambilani ikindedi, hiwamanyizeni.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yesu niyo abindiliza kwa kugamba, “Elo indeni meso kwaviya hammanyize kwizilwa kwenyu nokunde ni ini!<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wa wandima watatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Naho Useuta wa kulanga noukeige na mnt'hu akuita utafi awetange wandima wakwe niyo awatenda wakaulizi mwo ugoli wakwe wose. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Awenk'haga kila yumwenga enga viya adahile. Yumwenga kaikizilwa matundu mashano, yumwenga kaikizilwa matundu maidi, nt'huhu kaikizilwa dimwenga, kila yumwenga viligane no ludole lwakwe. Niyo yehe akeitila kwo utafi wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Yudya enk'higwe matunt'hu amashano, niyo akuyadamanyila ndima, niyo elesa mashano matuhu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Yudya ahokele amatundu maidi, yehe naye niyo elesa matundu maidi matuhu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Mna yudya ahokele tundu dimwenga, aitaga niyo adisimbila hasi no kudifisa hasi ditundu dyo mkulu ywakwe.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Yeze yomboke mazuwa mengi, zumbe wa wandima wadya wose auyaga, niyo wekala wakatalaula hamwenga na wandima wakwe yadya awasile. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mndima yudya ahokele matundu mashano, kegala matuhu mashano, akamgamba mkulu wakwe, ‘Mkulu waikizaga kwangu, matundu mashano.’ ‘Kaula! Hongeleza mashano matuhu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mkulu wakwe niyo amhitula, ‘Kutenda vedi mtumwa ywedi, kunda mhuwilwa mwe vint'hu vigeke, nohuike kunda mkulu mwe vint'hu vingi. Naho nou unde hamwenga no mkulu ywako mwe kinyemi chakwe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Yudya ahokele matundu maidi naye niyo eza akamgamba mkulu ywakwe, ‘Waniikizilaga matundu maidi, kaula higenyeza matuhu maidi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Yudya mkulu niyo amhitula, ‘Kutenda vedi mndima ywedi naho mhuwilwa!’ ‘Kunda mhuwilwa kwe vint'hu vigeke, nohutende mkulu mwe vint'hu vingi. So kinde hamwenga mwe kinyemi changu!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Niyo azigiila yudya ahokelega ditundu dimwenga, naye niyo amgamba mkulu ywakwe, ‘Himanya kugamba umnt'hu mdala, wavuna hadya hwitile mbeyu, naho waduganya hadya hwi myagile mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ivo nehyogoha niyo nagenda kudifisa ditundu dyako mwe sanga, kaula diaha diya idyako.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Mkulu ywakwe niyo amhitula, ‘Weye undima wiihile naho umsokezi wa ndima! Ivo nivo umanyize kugamba navuna hadya hii handile, naho naduganya hadya hitile mbeyu? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Mna vedi hegu waikize ditundu dyangu kwe kindolo kikuliha mtendese, kugamba mokuuya kwangu hegu nehihokela hamwenga nomtendese. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Mhokeni ditundu, mmwink'he yudya mta mlongo. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwaviya yeyose mtanacho naogenyezelwe no mtendese niyo vagenyela, mna yudya heiina, hata kiya kidodo ananacho naahokwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Naho mduuleni mtumwa mkiwa uyo kwo lwiza, nuko nokunde ndilo no kugwegwejula ameno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usengelo kwe dizuwa dyo uheelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Aho Mwana Mnt'hu akeza kwiza mwo wedi wakwe utendese, hamwenga na watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wose, neekale mwe difumbi dyo uwedi wakwe utendese. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Want'hu wose mwe isi zose, nawaduganywe hamwenga, naho naawapagule enga viya mdimi akupagula zingoto mwe difyo dye zimbuzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ngoto naayapaguile kulume kwakwe, zimbuzi naazipaguile kumoso kwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Seuta naawagambe wadya wose wekulume, ‘Soni nyuwe mvikilwe ni Tate, guheni kipe chenyu, useuta mwaikilagwa lumwe kukongela aho nk'hongo ho kuumbigwa isi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwaviya nakeivaga sala niyo wanink'ha chokudya, nakeivaga nk'hilu, niyo mwanink'ha chokunywa, nandaga mgeni, niyo mwanitendela ukise. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Nandaga hisakaza niyo mwanink'ha suke, nandaga mnyonge niyo mweza kunikaula, nandaga mvugailwa kwe divugailo, niyo mweza kunitalamkila.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Niyo awedi hameso yo Mnungu wamhitula kugamba, ‘Zumbe, niini kikuone una sala niyo chakwink'ha nk'hande? Hegu naho kikuona ini una nk'hilu niyo chakwink'ha chokunywa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Naho nekikuona ini kugamba weye wi mgeni niyo chakuhokela? Hegu kikuona hi usakaze niyo chakwink'ha suke? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Chakuonaga hii umnyonge, hegu du ukwedivugailo niyo cheza kukutalamkila?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Zumbe niyo ahitula kugamba, ‘Nawagambilani ikindedi, vovose viya mumdamanyile yumwenga mwa wadodo awa wandugu zangu, mnidamanyila miye.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Naho nawagambe wadya wekumoso kwakwe, ‘Halaweni aha hangu nyuwe mligitwe ni Mnungu, iteni mkengile kwo moto wa ulo na ulo uikilwe lumwe Mwavu na watumigwa wakwe! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Nehinda na sala, hamnink'hile chokudya, nehinda na nk'hilu, hamnink'hile mazi ninywe, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nandaga mgeni, hamnidamanyile ukise kwenyu, hisakaza, hamnink'hile suke, halumwa, naho nandaga hivugailwa kwe divugailo, hamwizile kunikaula.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Niho nawo nawahitule, ‘Zumbe, niini kikuone weye una sala, nk'hilu, hegu niini ukiizile niyo chaswesa kukutendela ukise, naho kikuone usakaze, undile mnyonge, no kuvugailwa kwe divugailo, niyo kiswesa kukudamanyila uwedi?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Niho Zumbe naawahitule, ‘Nawagambilani ikindedi, uneva hamuwambize yumwenga mwa awa wabeligwe, mlemela kunambiza miye.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Niho nawaite kokulumizwa hokukusila, mna wazumilwe kunda wedi kwa Mnungu nawaite kwo ugima wa ulo na ulo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mnyanyiko wa kumgwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu eze ajinke kuyalonga yose ayo, niyo awagamba awanamp'hina wakwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Enga viya mmanyize kugamba, yasigala mazuwa maidi kulongole neinde kinyemi che Pasaka, naho Mwana Mnt'hu naagwiligwe naho na awambigwe mwo kiwambilo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Naho wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wadala wa want'hu nawakint'hana kwe nyumba ya Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, etangagwa Kayafa, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />naho waikaga mzungu wa hamwenga wa kumgwila kwa kinyele Yesu no kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Niyo wagamba, “Isekunda mwedizuwa dya kinyemi, neinegale nk'humbizi mwa want'hu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahakwa mavuta uko Besania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Umwo Yesu andaga Besania mwe nyumba ya mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Simoni, mnt'hu aho nk'hongo andaga akalumwa unyonge wa ukoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Ezaga mvele yumwenga andaga na kijaluba kimemile mavuta yana mhemp'he ya utana utendese, niyo amsogeela Yesu Umwo wandaga ho ludyo, no kumgidila mwo mtwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Wanamp'hina wakwe weze wayaone ayo niyo waihiwa, wakalonga mwe mioyo yawe kugamba, “Kwaza uku kwa mbwai?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mavuta aya yo mhemp'he hegu yatagigwe kwa utana utendese niyo amatundu wenk'hwa awakiwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu eze ayamanye ayo, niyo awagamba, “Nii mwamsunk'ha sumka mvele uyu? Nakanidamanyila kint'hu chedi miye. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Awakiwa mnanao mazuwa yose aha, mna miye nekinda wose mazuwa yose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ukunigela mavuta aya yo mhemp'he mwo mwili wangu, andaga aniikila lumwe kwa amazisi yangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, hohose Imbuli Yedi ya Mnungu neibilikizwe mwe isi yose, iki atendile ne kitambulwe kwa kumkumbukila.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda azumila kumsezenga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Yumwenga mwa wadya mlongo na waidi etangagwa Yuda Isikaliyote aitaga kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />niyo awauza kugamba, “Nomnink'hei miye nna msezenga Yesu kwenyu?” Wamuwazilaga no kumwink'ha matundu milongo mitatu yakwitangwa shekeli. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kukongela aho Yuda naakazungula luneka lwa kumsezengela Yesu kwawo.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adya ludyo lwe Pasaka hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mwedizuwa dyank'hongo dye Mikate heigeligwe Ugwadu, wanamp'hina wezaga kwa Yesu na kumuuza, “Ni hii ukuunga kikaike lumwe kokudiila ludyo lwe Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Niyo awahitula, “Iteni kwa mnt'hu yumwenga, niyo mwamgamba Mhinizi agamba, ‘Dizuwa dyangu dibula, naunga hadye Pasaka na wanamp'hina wangu mwe nyumba yako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Wanamp'hina niyo watenda enga viya Yesu awasigiile, niyo waiikila lumwe uludyo lwe Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ize inde mwalagulo, Yesu nakekala yehe hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe mlongo na waidi ho ludyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Aho wandaga wakadya, agambaga, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, yumwenga mwa nyuwe naanisezenge.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Niyo wose wahuza kwa meso, niyo wakonga kulosanya wenye kwa wenye, kila mnt'hu no miyawe, “Zumbe ni miye hegu?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Yeyose yudya akuunga anatweeze hamwenga na miye mwe kihungu naani sezenge. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana Mnt'hu naungwe ayombokele yadya yose awandikilwe mo Mawandiko Akukile, mna naaligitwe yudya mnt'hu akuunga ana msengeze Mwana Mnt'hu! Hegu nevinda vedi mnt'hu enga uyo andile helekwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Niyo Yuda, yudya akuunga anamsengeze agamba, “Mhinizi ni miye hegu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu niyo amhitula, “Heiye weye kulonga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludyo lwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinso 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Aho wandile wakadya Yesu na kaguha mkate, niyo atogola Mnungu, niyo aubendula no kuwenk'ha wanamp'hina wakwe akagamba, “Guheni mdye. Uno nuwo umwili wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Naho niyo aguha kiamp'ha niyo alava nt'hogola no kuwenk'ha akagamba, “Nyweni nyose. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Ino niyo isakame yangu ye ndagano ikwitika kwa ajili ya want'hu wengi kwo kuusilwa wavu wawe. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nawagambilani, heninywe naho mwe cheleko che zabibu, kukongela ivi haluse mpaka mwe dizuwa umwo neninywe imp'yahamu hamwenga na nyuwe kwo Useuta wa Tate.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Weze wabinde kukema wila niyo wafosa kuita kwo Lugulu lwe Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela kulemelwa ni Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Niho Yesu akawagamba, “Kilo cha dielo nomwiihiwe kwajili miye, Kwaviya nivo yawandikagwa, Mnungu kagamba, ‘Nenimtowe mdimi, niyo zingoto ze difyo dyakwe nezikepange.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Mna hezakwinuka kulawa mwe kikuta, neniwalongoleni kuita Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo niyo agamba, “Wose uneva nawa kunyilika mna miye hikuvitenda ivo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nakugambila ikindedi, Ikilo iki zogolo dikei kuila, nounde kunilemela nk'hana nt'hatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petulo niyo agamba, “Uneva ni kukomwa hamwenga na weye nevinde iivo, mna hohuleke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Niyo wanamp'hina wose walonga iivo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombeza na wanamp'hina wakwe uko Getisemani.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-49">Luka 22:39-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Niyo Yesu aita hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe, hant'hu hakwitangwa Getisemani, niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Hake ikaleni aha, miye niite halongole ludogo hamlombeze Mnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Niyo awaguha Petulo na watuhu waidi wana Zebedayo hamwenga na Yehe, niyo akonga kwingilwa ni kinyulu na kiyangayanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Niyo awagamba, “Moyo wangu wingila kinyulu kwa usungu, hagihi no kubanika. Ikaleni aaha mnde meso hamwenga na miye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Niyo aita halongole ludodo no kufunamiza uso hasi, niyo alombeza. “Tate, uneva vadahika ndima ino indala ikunizila niusile, mna hiyo viya miye huunga, nevinde enga viya uukunga weye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Naho niyo auyaga kwa wanamp'hina wakwe, awabwiilaga wagona, niyo amuuza Petulo, “Nyuwe mdunduga kunda na miye hata kwa saa dimwenga du? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Indeni meso, naho mlombeze Mnungu mnase kwingila mo kugezigwa. Moyo wa mnt'hu waungisa kudamanya vedi mna umwili uhwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yesu afosaga kaidi kulombeza Mnungu akagamba, “Tate, ivi havikudahika imbuli ino inombokele kunk'handa mpaka inibwiile? Mna nevinde enga viya uungile weye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Eze awauiye vituhu, awabwiilaga wagona, kwaviya meso yawe nayanda yazama.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Awasaga niyo aita naho katatu komlombeza Mnungu akavuzagiza ulosi uudya. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Niyo auya kwa wanamp'hina wakwe awagamba “Mkei gonile? Kauleni, sa ibula yo Mwana Mnt'hu kugeligwa mwe mikono ya want'hu wavu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Inukeni, kiteni kwaviya yudya akunisezenga keza!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugwiligwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Umwo andile akagendeela kulonga, Yuda, yudya yumwenga wawadya mlongo na waidi ezaga hamwenga na fyo dya want'hu wavaile kink'hondo wenule mijungo, hamwenga na malungu. Nawatumigwa wa kwe mbingu ni wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wadala vilongozi wa want'hu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Naho yudya umsezengi nakawenk'ha kilagiso akawagamba, “Mnt'hu uyo huunga nimnamse kwa lukunde, nuuyo, mgwileni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Niyo aita ludole kwa Yesu, niyo amlamsa “Mhinizi, ndamsa!” Niyo amnonela.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mbuyangu damanya idya ikutendile wize.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Niyo wamkumpukila Yesu, niyo wamgwila. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wa Yesu andaga na gola dyakwe mwe yala, niyo adisomola nokumtoa niyo amsenga digutwi mtumwa wo Mkulu ywa walava nt'hambiko. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu niyo amgamba mwanamp'hina ywakwe, “Vuza digola mwe yala yakwe, kwaviya kila akukoma kwa gola naakomwe kwa digola. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Hamamanyize kugamba miye nadaha kumloeza Tate, niyo anigaila mafyo yakujink'ha mlongo na maidi ya mtumigwa ywa nk'hondo haluse ivi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Mna Mawandiko Akukile udya ukugamba, vaungwa aya yose kulaila, noukint'he vivihi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Aho Yesu awauzaga wadya wezile kumgwila, “Nyuwe mwiza na fundo na malungu vileke mnigwile, mazuwa yose nehinda mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu hahiniza, mna hamwanigwilaga du! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Mna aya yose yalaila vileke yadya yawandikwa na walotezi wa Mnungu yakint'he.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Niho wanamp'hina wakwe wanyilika no kunyilika.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu he kitala cha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Wadya wamgwilaga Yesu wamwigalaga kwe nyumba ya Kayafa uyo Mkulu ywa walava nt'hambiko, aho andaga hamwenga na wahinizi we miko na wadala vilongozi wa want'hu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petulo naakamtimila luhalehale mpaka kwo uwa we nyumba yo Mkulu ywa walava nt'hambiko, engilaga uko kundani, niyo ekala akakaula ya kumlaila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ivo Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na want'hu we kitala, wandaga wakazungula mizungu ya udant'hi, vileke Yesu akomigwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />mna wadundugaga hamwenga na kugamba, wezaga want'hu wengi wakamziga. Uuko uko walailaga want'hu waidi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />na kugamba, “Mnt'hu uyu agambaga hambwe adaha kuimola Inyumba ino ya Mnungu niyo aizenga naho mwa mazuwa matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko akimaalaga na kumgamba Yesu, “Hukuhitula kint'hu mwa aya wakuku longeleza?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Mna Yesu handile no uhituzi wowose. Mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko niyo amgamba, “Nakulapiza mwe dizina dya Mnungu emgima, kigambile hegu kindedi weye niwe Kilisito Mkombozi Mwana ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Niyo Yesu ahitula, “Heiye ayo ukulonga naayo. Mna nawagambilani nyuwe nyose, mazuwa na yeze aho nommuwone Mwana Mnt'hu akekala kulume kwa Mnungu mta Udahi, akeza mwa mavunde ya kwe mbingu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Aho niyo Mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko atatula isuke yakwe yo ukulu akagamba, “kamlonga vihile, chaungai naho kulawa kwa waona? Mwiva ivo alongile vihile! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Haluse mwagaaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Niyo wahitula, “Anamasa, kawagilwa kukomwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Niyo wamtweela mate mwo uso, no kumtoa, akajika wadya wamtoile, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />wamgamba, “Kilisito, lotela, niani akutoile!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petulo ekalaga kuse ye kitala, aho eziilagwa ni mvele yumwenga mtumwa wa Mkulu akamgamba, “Weye nawe nokunda hamwenga na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Mna aulemelaga ulosi uwo mwa meso yawe wose akagamba, “Hikukimanya kia mkulonga,” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Niyo Petulo afosa kuse yo nk'hili ye nyumba ye kitala. Mtumwa mtuhu mvele nakamuona niyo awagamba wadya wandile hadya, “Mnt'hu uyu nawandanya na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petulo niyo akana kaidi kwa kukelisa akagamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi himmanyize mnt'hu uyu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Lupisi ludodo wadya wakimalaga hadya hagihi na Petulo wamgambaga, “Ikindedi, Petulo nawe uyumwenga mwa woho, kwaviya hata milosi yako yakilagisa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Petulo niyo agamba, “Mnungu kamanya kagamba nalonga kindedi, neniligitwe uneva nadant'ha, himmanyize mnt'hu uyu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Aaho zogolo niyo dyaila. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Naho niyo Petulo akumbukila yadya Yesu amgambilaga kugamba, “Zogolo nedinde hadinati kuila weye nounde kunilemela nk'hanana nt'hatu, kugamba hunimanyize.” Aitaga kuse niyo aila kwa usungu mkulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Mtondo tondo, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wose hamwenga ne wadala vilongozi va want'hu wadamanyaga mzungu wawe wa kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Niyo wamkakiliza mp'hingu no kumlongoza wakamwigala kwa Pilato, mkulu wo mkowa asagulwe ni mkulu we Kilumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifile ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Imitendele 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Aho Yuda msezengi eze aone kugamba Yesu kasengelwa kukomwa, nakakeiva usungu mwo moyo wakwe, niyo ayavuza yadya matundu milongo mitatu, kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wadala vilongozi wa want'hu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Niyo Yuda umsezengi agamba, “Hindamanya wavu kwaviya hisezenga mnt'hu heedamanye lema dyodyose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Niyo woho wamhitula kugamba, “Iyo haimwetu suwe, noumanye weye mwenye!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yuda ayaduulaga amatundu kwe nyumba idya ya Mnungu, niyo ahalawa, no kugenda kukenyulika yehe mwenye.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wayalogotaga amatundu wakagamba, “Hivo vedi kuyagela amatundu aya mwe kindolo cho kumlavila Mnungu malavo, kwaviya matundu aya ni ya sakame.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Weze wazumilane kwa idyo, matundu yadya wayaguilaga nk'honde ya kilongo hande hant'hu ha kuwamosa msanga want'hu wageni. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Naho nivo vikuleka hant'hu aho hetangwa “Mgunda wa Sakame” hata diyelo.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Niho yadya alongaga mlotezi Yelemia kunda kindedi kugamba, “Nawaguha matundu milongo mitatu, nicho kihimo cha want'hu wa Izilaeli wazumilaga kumliha. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Naho matundu ayo wayaguilaga hant'hu hana ulongo wa kilongo enga viya Zumbe anisigiilaga miye.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato amuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu akimaalaga ha Pilato mkulu wo Mkoa aho amuuzaga, “Weye ni weye Seuta ywe Kiyahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu niyo amhitula, “Ivo ukulonga ni iivo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Mna hahitulaga dyodyose aho akalongelezwa ni Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wadala vilongozi wa want'hu.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilato niyo amgamba, “Wayeva aya yose wakukulongeleza?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Mna Yesu alemelaga kulonga mbuli yoyose, imtendile Pilato mkulu wo Mkowa kwehelwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asengelwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Handaga na kihendo kugamba, want'hu wakabula mwe dizuwa dye Pasaka, mkulu wo Mkoa alekela mvugailwa yumwenga wakumuunga. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Elo kwandaga na mvugailwa yumwenga amanyikisaga, etangagwa Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ivo want'hu weze waduganyike, Pilato awauzaga, “Mwaunga miye niwakomoeleni ani mwa wafungwa awa, Balaba hegu Yesu akwitangwa Kilisito mkombozi?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Awamanyaga vedi kugamba Wayahudi wandaga wakamlongeleza Yesu haheina lema.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Umwo Pilato andaga kekala mwe difumbi cho usengelo wa masa, mkaziwe amwigailaga ulosi kugamba, “Usekunda na mbuli naye mnt'hu uyo uywedi, kwaviya hionesa makulu mwa yehe, mwe zisozi ze kikilo chomboke.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wadala vilongozi wa want'hu, wawatendaga want'hu kumgamba Pilato amlekele Balaba mna Yesu asengelwe kukomwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Mna Pilato awauzaga want'hu kugamba, “Niani mkuunga nimlekele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Niyo wagamba, “Balaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato awauzaga naho, “Uyu Yesu akwitangwa Kilisito nimtende vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Niyo wahitula, “Muwambe mo mti wa masulmizo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato niyo auza vituhu, “Kabanangai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Niyo wakonga kutoa lwasu kwa kukweza maizwi, “Muwambe mo mti wa masulmizo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato eze aone kugamba hakuzumilwa kwa dyodyose, mna henuka nk'humbizi, aguhaga mazi, niyo ahaka mikono yakwe wakamsinya wose, niyo awagamba, “Kukomwa kwo umnt'hu uyu hakwi mwangu, nomkaule nyuwe wenye.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Want'hu wose niyo wamhitula, “Sakame yakwe ileke inde mwetu hamwenga na wana wetu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pilato niyo amlekela Balaba, eze Yesu eze atoigwe mikotya, niyo awenk'ha Yesu vileke wakamuwamba mo mti wa masulmizo.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wank'hondo we Kilumi wamsezigila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Wank'hondo wa Pilato niyo wamgela Yesu he nyumba yo mkulu wo Mkowa, niyo wose wamzugulukila. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Niyo wamhambula zisuke zakwe, no kumvala suke ya kiseuta. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Naho niyo wadamanya taji ya miwa, niyo wamtungizila mo mtwi enga taji, niyo wamwink'ha ngoda ya kiseuta momkono wakwe wo kulume, akajika wamfikila madi, niyo wajumbwizila wakagamba, “Ndamsa we Zumbe we Kiyahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wamtweelaga mate mwa meso, niyo wamtoa ngoda mwo mtwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Weze wabinde kumtendela ujumbwizi, wamhambulaga idya isuke ye kiseuta, no kumvala zia izakwe. Aho niyo wamlongoza kuse kwo kumuwamba mwo mti kiwambilo.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambigwe mwo msalaba mo mti wa masulmizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Umwo wandaga wakaita, wabwiilaga mnt'hu kulawa Kilene etangagwa Simoni, niyo wadya wank'hondo wamtigizaga kukinula kiwambilo cha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Wabulaga hamwenga hakwitangwa Goligota, “Hant'hu ha kibela cha Mtwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Niho wamwink'hilaga, mazi ya gwaduke, mna eze alume niyo ayalemela.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nawamuwamba mo mti wa masulmizo niyo wakepangila izisuke zakwe kwa kuzitoela kula. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Niyo wekala aaho wakamwamila. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Halanga homtwi wakwe wawandikaga ivo viwandikwe yalekile wakamgela mwa masa, ya kugamba, “Uyu niye Yesu, Zumbe ywa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Naho nawawambigwa mwe viwambilo watuhu waidi wandaga wahoki, yumwenga kulume mtuhu kumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Want'hu wandaga wakomboka, wamhomolaga, uku wakasingisa imitwi yawe, na kugamba, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Weye hiwe wagambaga wadaha kuimola Inyumba ino ya Mnungu niyo izenga naho kwa mazuwa matatu! Uneva niwe Mwana ywa Mnungu keyokole kulawa kwo msalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wahinizi we zi Sigilizi na wadya wadala vilongozi, wamgelaga mabelo wakagamba, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Ayokolaga weyawe, hakudaha kukeyokola ye mwenye! Yehe hi zumbe wa Waizilaeli? Naakeseleze elo kulawa mwe kiwambilo, naswe nekimhuwile! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Kamhuwila Mnungu no kuke gamba yehe Mwana ywa Mnungu. Vedi, goja kikaule uneva Mnungu amuunga kindedi naa myokole!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Wadya awahoki wawambigwe hamwenga na yehe nao niyo wamkalaliza.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambigwa mo mti wa masulmizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kukongela sa mtandatu, mpaka sa kanda kisingi handaga na ziza mwe isi yose. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ize ibuze mwe sa kanda Yesu alavaga diizwi akagamba, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Nuko kugamba, “Mnungu, Mnungu wanasa vivihi?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Want'hu wamwenga mwa wadya wandaga aaho weze weve, nawagamba, “Uyu amwitanga Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Aaho niyo yumwenga aguluka no kuguha nk'hata imemile mazi yagwaduke niyo iisomeka mwo lukombosha nokugeza kumnywesa.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Wadya wamwenga niyo wagamba, “Mnekeni kikaule uneva Eliya neeze amhonye.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu niyo akweza diizwi kwa kuila, niyo aseleza umoyo.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Niyo dipazia dyandile mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu dyatatuka hagati, kulawa kulanga mpaka hasi. Isi niyo yasingisika nyuwe niyo zatulika. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Vikuta vagubukaga, want'hu wafaga, wasuntilwa wa Mnungu niyo wafosa mwe vikuta. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Weze wafose mwe vikuta, naho Yesu eze ande kauyuka, waitaga kwo mzi Akukile Yelusalemu, uko waonagwa, ni want'hu wengi.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Yudya mkulu wa wank'hondo, hamwenga na wank'hondo wadya wandanye wakamwamila Yesu weze waone idisingisa hamwenga ne zimbuli zilaile hadya, wogohesaga, niyo wagamba, “Ikindedi uyu andaga Mwana ywa Mnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Kwandaga na wavele wengi, wandaga wakasinya kwa luhale. Woho nawo wamtimilaga Yesu kulawa Galilaya, naho wandaga wakaika mwambiza. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mwa awoho wandaga aaho maliamu Magedalena, Maliamu nine dya Yakobo na Yusufu, na mkaza Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoswa msanga kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ize inde mwalagulo, mgoli yumwenga kulawa Alimatayo, akwitangwa Yusufu yehe naye andaga mwanamp'hina ywa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Amwiitilaga Pilato no kuulombeza umwili wa Yesu. Pilato asiigilaga kugamba Yusufu enk'higwe umwili wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu niyo auguha umwili wa Yesu no kuuvala sanda yedi, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />niyo akuwiika kwe kikuta chakwe mwenye akedamanyilaga, kwa kuupuka mwo luwe lutogile, niyo atongolosa iwe kulu, no kugubika ho mwingiilo we kikuta icho, niyo ahalawa. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliamu Magedalena na yudya Maliamu umtuhu, wekalaga hadya wakaika kukaula ikikuta.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikuta chamilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Zuwa ditimile dyandaga zuwa dya Kuhumula. Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo wabwilanaga kwa Pilato <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe, kikumbukila kugamba yudya mdant'hi aho andaga mgima agambaga, ‘Mwe dizuwa dya katatu neninde hiuyuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Sigiila kugamba hadya he kikuta hamilwe kindedi ndedi mwa mazuwa aya matatu, vileke wanamp'hina wakwe wasekudaha kuita, niyo waubawa umwili udya, niyo wawagamba want'hu kugamba, kauyuka. Lulimi ulu lwa kaidi nolunde lwiihisa kujink'ha ludya lwa nk'hongo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato niyo awagamba, “Yamileni,” “Iteni niyo mwamila kikuta kwa udahi wenyu wose”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ivo wahalawaga niyo wakuika wamizi kwe kikuta, kwa kukanda kikuta, no kuika want'hu wakwamila.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Dize dyomboke dizuwa dyo kuhumula, aho kwandaga kukatandazuka, Maliamu Magedalena na yudya Maliamu mtuhu, wagendaga kukaula ikikuta. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Halailaga kisingisa kikulu, kwaviya mtumigwa ywa Zumbe aseelaga kulawa kulanga niyo eza hadya he kikuta, no kuditongolosa diya diiwe, no kwikala mnanga mwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Ifuta yakwe yandaga ikamweka enga lumwemwe, suke zakwe nazo zang'alaga mbee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Wadya awamizi wogohesaga weze wamuwone uyo mtumigwa ywa Zumbe, niyo wengila lukengent'ha naho nawanda enga want'hu wabanike.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo awagamba wadya wavele, “Msekogoha, himanya mwiza kumkaula Yesu, yudya awambagwa mwo msalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Hahali aha! Kauyuka enga viya alongaga, soni mkaule hadya wamwikaga. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />sunguzeni mwiite mkawagambile wanamp'hina wakwe kugamba, ‘Kauyuka, naho kawalongoela kuita Galilaya, nuko nomkamuwone!’ Kumbukileni ayo niwagambileni.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Niyo wadya wavele wasunguza kuhalawa uku wakogoha. Mna nawanda na kinyemi, wagulukaga kugenda kuwagambila wanamp'hina wakwe.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Aho niyo Yesu awalaila naho niyo awalamsa akawagamba, “Ndamsa.” Niyo wambasa no kumtoza mwe viga, niyo wamfikila madi waka mvika. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Msekogoha, iteni mkawagambile wandugu zangu, waite Galilaya, nuko nawakanione.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simulizi ya wank'hondo wamizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Umwo wadya wavele wandaga wakaita, wamizi wamwenga waitaga kwo mzi kuwagambila wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko no kuwagambila kila kint'hu kilaile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Elo nawadugana hamwenga na wadala vilongozi na kuivana kuwenk'ha wadya watowani matundu mengi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />na kuwagamba, “Mgambe ivi, wanamp'hina wakwe naweza nekilo kigonile niyo waubawa umwili wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Naho imbuli ino inevika kwo mkulu we isi, suwe nekilonge naye, msekunda na kituletule.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ivo wamizi niyo waguha matundu nokutenda enga viya wasigiilwe. Naho mbuli iyo yagendezwaga mwe isi yose ya Wayahudi hata mwa mazuwa aya yadielo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akelaviliza kwa wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Imitendele 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Wadya wanamp'hina mlongo na yumwenga waitaga kwo lugulu lwa Galilaya, kudya Yesu awagambaga waite. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Weze wamuwone Yesu, niyo wamvika mna wamwenga mwawe wandaga wakang'asa ng'asa. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu awasogeelaga niyo awagamba, “Hink'higwa udahi wose, kulanga na mwe isi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Waitileni want'hu wose mwe si zose, muwatende kunda wanamp'hina wangu, mkawabatiza kwa zina dya Tate, na dyo Mwana, na dya Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Naho wahinizeni kuyatimila yadya yose niwasigiileni nyuwe. Naho mmanye kugamba miye ni hamwenga na nyuwe mazuwa yose, mpaka kwo uheelo we zimbuli zose.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>